(4602761, 663737, 89723, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I hate the Yankees. Okay. Hate is a strong word. I strongly dislike the Yankees. Looking beyond the subject matter and commenting on the photo, I thought you did a decent job. I think this photo says more about the trainer and the stuff they have to put up with than it does about A-Rod. An honestly, that''s sort of refreshing. Though you may want to hang on to this shot, it might be famous in ten years. The trainer might be doing more than just helping him out with his balance. (There I go attacking the Yankees again. I can''t help it. Sorry) The good news is, I rated your photo higher than my average. 7</td>', 'Sorry, I hate the Yankees. Okay. Hate is a strong word. I strongly dislike the Yankees. Looking beyond the subject matter and commenting on the photo, I thought you did a decent job. I think this photo says more about the trainer and the stuff they have to put up with than it does about A-Rod. An honestly, that''s sort of refreshing. Though you may want to hang on to this shot, it might be famous in ten years. The trainer might be doing more than just helping him out with his balance. (There I go attacking the Yankees again. I can''t help it. Sorry) The good news is, I rated your photo higher than my average. 7', '2008-04-01 13:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
