(4603022, 664498, 68956, '<td valign="top">I like the detailed action here, great focus and I know that''s not easy as they never keep still. It''s just a bit oversaturated but overall a nice image :)</td>', 'I like the detailed action here, great focus and I know that''s not easy as they never keep still. It''s just a bit oversaturated but overall a nice image :)', '2008-04-01 15:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
