(4603033, 663043, 68956, '<td valign="top">Great angle, the swimming goggles and expression really make it. I also like the way the bright highlights emphasise the glare of a sunny day at the seaside. Well done :)</td>', 'Great angle, the swimming goggles and expression really make it. I also like the way the bright highlights emphasise the glare of a sunny day at the seaside. Well done :)', '2008-04-01 15:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
