(4603045, 663658, 50695, '<td valign="top">nicely exposed shot. I know how tricky that is inside a cathedral. this composition has been done to death, however.</td>', 'nicely exposed shot. I know how tricky that is inside a cathedral. this composition has been done to death, however.', '2008-04-01 15:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603046, 664404, 50695, '<td valign="top">the high contrast is exciting, but the composition is dull.</td>', 'the high contrast is exciting, but the composition is dull.', '2008-04-01 15:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603049, 655373, 50695, '<td valign="top">the dying rose is lost in shadow. the in-studio appearance gives this a rather clinical feel.</td>', 'the dying rose is lost in shadow. the in-studio appearance gives this a rather clinical feel.', '2008-04-01 15:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603054, 660343, 50695, '<td valign="top">that grill is freaking me out. it''s practically vibrating. it''s reaching out from the picture and poking me in the eye. Really odd processing job. Maybe it was a big crop that forced you to blow up the image and reveal some noise? I wonder if you had to crop so much. This composition is rather dull, with the subject filling the frame. Gotta give you a point for that grill, though!</td>', 'that grill is freaking me out. it''s practically vibrating. it''s reaching out from the picture and poking me in the eye. Really odd processing job. Maybe it was a big crop that forced you to blow up the image and reveal some noise? I wonder if you had to crop so much. This composition is rather dull, with the subject filling the frame. Gotta give you a point for that grill, though!', '2008-04-01 16:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603055, 663955, 15511, '<td valign="top">Having two subjects is confusing, I want to look at the lighthouse, but it''s not well focused.</td>', 'Having two subjects is confusing, I want to look at the lighthouse, but it''s not well focused.', '2008-04-01 16:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603056, 662758, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice, peaceful image. not very exciting, though, unless you''ve never seen an aurora before.</td>', 'nice, peaceful image. not very exciting, though, unless you''ve never seen an aurora before.', '2008-04-01 16:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603061, 658790, 50695, '<td valign="top">something metallic, robotic about this image. The painting with light is perhaps meant to symbolize music, but is too much like the guitar. perhaps if the light had a different color temperature then we would get the feeling of something special emanating from the guitar. Right now it just looks like something is caught in the strings. Nice shapes on the curves, though. But the composition is a little cramped.</td>', 'something metallic, robotic about this image. The painting with light is perhaps meant to symbolize music, but is too much like the guitar. perhaps if the light had a different color temperature then we would get the feeling of something special emanating from the guitar. Right now it just looks like something is caught in the strings. Nice shapes on the curves, though. But the composition is a little cramped.', '2008-04-01 16:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603062, 664462, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image, the tonality is really well done. Also nice to see the detail in the shadows.</td>', 'Nice image, the tonality is really well done. Also nice to see the detail in the shadows.', '2008-04-01 16:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603063, 664418, 15291, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, love the lighting.</td>', 'Fantastic, love the lighting.', '2008-04-01 16:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603068, 664168, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, the composition is great love your placement of the foreground.</td>', 'Nicely done, the composition is great love your placement of the foreground.', '2008-04-01 16:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603073, 664430, 15511, '<td valign="top">Image looks dark like the faux nighttime look of old movies, I would liked to have seen more detail in the shadows. Else, I like the detail expressed in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Image looks dark like the faux nighttime look of old movies, I would liked to have seen more detail in the shadows. Else, I like the detail expressed in B&W.', '2008-04-01 16:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603074, 658187, 50695, '<td valign="top">pretty good composition with leading lines that point to your subject''s brain. It makes us wonder what she''s thinking. It''s a little too posed for my taste, but there is a hint here of a real girl, perhaps a little impatient with this exercise. As a viewer, my plea is: give me something to believe in.</td>', 'pretty good composition with leading lines that point to your subject''s brain. It makes us wonder what she''s thinking. It''s a little too posed for my taste, but there is a hint here of a real girl, perhaps a little impatient with this exercise. As a viewer, my plea is: give me something to believe in.', '2008-04-01 16:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603077, 664230, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice detail &amp; catch light, an all around strong capture.</td>', 'Nice detail & catch light, an all around strong capture.', '2008-04-01 16:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
