(4603085, 657921, 50695, '<td valign="top">you''ve got to work on your dialog. ;) I like the chaotic composition, but I think it clashes with your attempt to tell a story that exists only in the foreground. Perhaps this is because the birds are centered vertically. That might be a mistake.</td>', 'you''ve got to work on your dialog. ;) I like the chaotic composition, but I think it clashes with your attempt to tell a story that exists only in the foreground. Perhaps this is because the birds are centered vertically. That might be a mistake.', '2008-04-01 16:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
