(4603097, 662594, 50695, '<td valign="top">it''s okay... kind of a good composition with a dramatic imbalance to the left... the watchtower is almost personified... the details are sharp and there''s a real sense of three dimensions. overall it doesn''t quite grab my attention, though.</td>', 'it''s okay... kind of a good composition with a dramatic imbalance to the left... the watchtower is almost personified... the details are sharp and there''s a real sense of three dimensions. overall it doesn''t quite grab my attention, though.', '2008-04-01 16:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
