(4603102, 663530, 50695, '<td valign="top">something seems a little off with the composition. I wonder if that tree is too centered on the vertical axis. Not sure the blue on the right balances all the stuff that''s going on on the left.</td>', 'something seems a little off with the composition. I wonder if that tree is too centered on the vertical axis. Not sure the blue on the right balances all the stuff that''s going on on the left.', '2008-04-01 16:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603110, 663351, 50695, '<td valign="top">dull colors and noise from what I assume was a big crop. I like it. Makes it seem like an oil painting or a study for an oil painting. interesting diagonal on the bird tail. The simplification of color to mostly greens and browns makes the chaotic subject matter easier to look at. The birds just blend into the sticks of the background, meaning that really there is no subject. Just shapes and colors in a composition. I like that.</td>', 'dull colors and noise from what I assume was a big crop. I like it. Makes it seem like an oil painting or a study for an oil painting. interesting diagonal on the bird tail. The simplification of color to mostly greens and browns makes the chaotic subject matter easier to look at. The birds just blend into the sticks of the background, meaning that really there is no subject. Just shapes and colors in a composition. I like that.', '2008-04-01 16:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603120, 661915, 15511, '<td valign="top">How fortunate to be able to save an unusual sight and express it in an image. The Adams-like range of tones and the balance of the opposition of shapes and lighting is commendable.</td>', 'How fortunate to be able to save an unusual sight and express it in an image. The Adams-like range of tones and the balance of the opposition of shapes and lighting is commendable.', '2008-04-01 16:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603124, 664419, 58457, '<td valign="top">Once I realized what was going on in this I was pretty impressed.</td>', 'Once I realized what was going on in this I was pretty impressed.', '2008-04-01 16:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603133, 664279, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is good for a jellyfish shot. the extreme processing has rendered it almost into bright brushstrokes, and the composition leaves a remarkable amount of room around the jellyfish, giving a sense of vast space, perhaps a Universe. It doesn''t quite transcend "jellyfish shot", but it is a good example of one. (in case you''re wondering, that puts you squarely into my "6" territory)</td>', 'this is good for a jellyfish shot. the extreme processing has rendered it almost into bright brushstrokes, and the composition leaves a remarkable amount of room around the jellyfish, giving a sense of vast space, perhaps a Universe. It doesn''t quite transcend "jellyfish shot", but it is a good example of one. (in case you''re wondering, that puts you squarely into my "6" territory)', '2008-04-01 16:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
