(4604100, 661165, 62006, '<td valign="top">A good shot of a wise old gentleman. The colors don''t really pop out at you but I think I understand what you where rying to convey. Nice focus and detail and good crop.</td>', 'A good shot of a wise old gentleman. The colors don''t really pop out at you but I think I understand what you where rying to convey. Nice focus and detail and good crop.', '2008-04-01 23:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
