(4604318, 664465, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t sure I liked the crop at first but it''s growing on me (not trying to be punny, honest).  DOF and tones are lovely.</td>', 'Wasn''t sure I liked the crop at first but it''s growing on me (not trying to be punny, honest).  DOF and tones are lovely.', '2008-04-02 00:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604322, 656583, 65234, '<td valign="top">It does look quite harsh.  The brown tones, especially in the water, contribute to a rather desolate feeling.  Not completely, though, because there is light, making me feel there may be something less depressing just out of sight on the left.</td>', 'It does look quite harsh.  The brown tones, especially in the water, contribute to a rather desolate feeling.  Not completely, though, because there is light, making me feel there may be something less depressing just out of sight on the left.', '2008-04-02 00:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604326, 660013, 65234, '<td valign="top">It looks like it has a hunchback.  Don''t think I''ve seen one of these before; not pretty, but quite interesting.</td>', 'It looks like it has a hunchback.  Don''t think I''ve seen one of these before; not pretty, but quite interesting.', '2008-04-02 00:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604332, 662729, 37392, '<td valign="top">cartago?</td>', 'cartago?', '2008-04-02 00:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604341, 661165, 65234, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better in B&amp;W.  Or at least some desat on the bloodshot eyes so they don''t look so world-weary.  Something about the bloodshot eyes and his expression make him look more resigned than wise to me, though I suppose there are circumstances where one equates to the other.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better in B&W.  Or at least some desat on the bloodshot eyes so they don''t look so world-weary.  Something about the bloodshot eyes and his expression make him look more resigned than wise to me, though I suppose there are circumstances where one equates to the other.', '2008-04-02 00:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604346, 664453, 65234, '<td valign="top">Quite a different setting from the fields where one usually sees bison.  Nice find and dreamy sort of quality which goes nicely with the unusual setting.</td>', 'Quite a different setting from the fields where one usually sees bison.  Nice find and dreamy sort of quality which goes nicely with the unusual setting.', '2008-04-02 00:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604352, 662442, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and composition but this seems overprocessed to me.</td>', 'I like the subject and composition but this seems overprocessed to me.', '2008-04-02 00:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604364, 659154, 44453, '<td valign="top">the processing has a beautiful timeless feel about it, until you notice the wires running through the photo.  real shame...  And I hate it when people say this to me but you probably could have got away with cloning them out with the advanced editing rules.<br/>It''s still beautiful though</td>', 'the processing has a beautiful timeless feel about it, until you notice the wires running through the photo.  real shame...  And I hate it when people say this to me but you probably could have got away with cloning them out with the advanced editing rules.It''s still beautiful though', '2008-04-02 00:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604365, 661721, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the flame-like clouds.  Lighting is a bit harsh on the tree but the composition and colors are so nice I''m not minding the harshness as much as I usually do.</td>', 'Love the flame-like clouds.  Lighting is a bit harsh on the tree but the composition and colors are so nice I''m not minding the harshness as much as I usually do.', '2008-04-02 00:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604367, 663960, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like an alien sort of bus preparing to disappear into another dimension.  Quite a shot!</td>', 'Looks like an alien sort of bus preparing to disappear into another dimension.  Quite a shot!', '2008-04-02 00:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604373, 664375, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  Her reflection in the puddle and the way she has her free hand pulled into her jacket are such nice details of an everyday moment worth remembering.  As long as she''s got Daddy''s hand she''s perfectly happy to head into the foggy future.</td>', 'This is lovely.  Her reflection in the puddle and the way she has her free hand pulled into her jacket are such nice details of an everyday moment worth remembering.  As long as she''s got Daddy''s hand she''s perfectly happy to head into the foggy future.', '2008-04-02 00:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604376, 660579, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Kind of American Beauty-ish.</td>', 'Interesting.  Kind of American Beauty-ish.', '2008-04-02 00:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604377, 663586, 65234, '<td valign="top">The windows open!!  Much more interesting than if all the windows were sealed shut.</td>', 'The windows open!!  Much more interesting than if all the windows were sealed shut.', '2008-04-02 00:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604381, 663223, 19708, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely stunning !<br/>Can''t say enough about the lighting here and the way this is presented.<br/>Had to come back and add that this is absolutely my favorite in this challenge.<br/>I love when an image stops me dead in my tracks and can''t navigate away from it.<br/>Amazing.<br/>Bravo!</td>', 'This is absolutely stunning !Can''t say enough about the lighting here and the way this is presented.Had to come back and add that this is absolutely my favorite in this challenge.I love when an image stops me dead in my tracks and can''t navigate away from it.Amazing.Bravo!', '2008-04-02 00:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604383, 663240, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I have a few Tidal Basin shots of my own this year but I didn''t enter any.  Such a lovely walk; it''s worth it even with all the tourists ;-)  You managed to have the monument and trees take center stage, as they should.</td>', 'Very nice.  I have a few Tidal Basin shots of my own this year but I didn''t enter any.  Such a lovely walk; it''s worth it even with all the tourists ;-)  You managed to have the monument and trees take center stage, as they should.', '2008-04-02 00:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604389, 655930, 65234, '<td valign="top">My dogs certainly think snow is fabulous, but they didn''t get much this year.  The yellow-looking eyes are a little freaky; I might prefer a completely B&amp;W treatment.</td>', 'My dogs certainly think snow is fabulous, but they didn''t get much this year.  The yellow-looking eyes are a little freaky; I might prefer a completely B&W treatment.', '2008-04-02 00:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
