(4604609, 662815, 65234, '<td valign="top">To me the bright pink and disconnected supporting hands in the same image are rather disturbing.  I think I would have much preferred a straight B&amp;W shot (the bow and hairband and lace give away the baby''s gender, if it matters that the viewer know that, although it''s not clear to me why it would).  Still, her head is not visibly supported and that''s worrying to me.  But perhaps you meant for the viewer to be disturbedby her incomplete support.</td>', 'To me the bright pink and disconnected supporting hands in the same image are rather disturbing.  I think I would have much preferred a straight B&W shot (the bow and hairband and lace give away the baby''s gender, if it matters that the viewer know that, although it''s not clear to me why it would).  Still, her head is not visibly supported and that''s worrying to me.  But perhaps you meant for the viewer to be disturbedby her incomplete support.', '2008-04-02 01:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4604622, 658827, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  One of these visits the zoo here for the summer every year.  I get a huge kick out of the tourists looking at all the birds in their enclosures while the heron sits above them in a tree, unnoticed and gloriously free.</td>', 'Very nice!  One of these visits the zoo here for the summer every year.  I get a huge kick out of the tourists looking at all the birds in their enclosures while the heron sits above them in a tree, unnoticed and gloriously free.', '2008-04-02 01:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
