(4607246, 659631, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s an awesome scene, I like the texture of the water. It wants to be a "WOW" shot, but it''s not quite there. I can''t quite place it.</td>', 'It''s an awesome scene, I like the texture of the water. It wants to be a "WOW" shot, but it''s not quite there. I can''t quite place it.', '2008-04-02 14:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
