(4607281, 660468, 83313, '<td valign="top">DOF is a little shallow, the effect of that does fine on her hair, but the softness on the lower part of her face does not look right. Otherwise, its a nice portrait.</td>', 'DOF is a little shallow, the effect of that does fine on her hair, but the softness on the lower part of her face does not look right. Otherwise, its a nice portrait.', '2008-04-02 14:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
