(4607300, 664015, 77838, '<td valign="top">Your DOF here really helps in allowing the background to not be a distraction.  I like the bright colors of the white and orange fur.  <br/> <br/>The only thing that could maybe be different would be to move the framing to the left a little so as to not crop the tail.  Not a big deal. -BB</td>', 'Your DOF here really helps in allowing the background to not be a distraction.  I like the bright colors of the white and orange fur.   The only thing that could maybe be different would be to move the framing to the left a little so as to not crop the tail.  Not a big deal. -BB', '2008-04-02 14:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4607304, 664104, 77838, '<td valign="top">This has a very complimentary border.  It definitely helps enhance the mood of the sky. -BB</td>', 'This has a very complimentary border.  It definitely helps enhance the mood of the sky. -BB', '2008-04-02 14:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4607305, 662073, 56539, '<td valign="top">Getting rid of the blue could have helped your image</td>', 'Getting rid of the blue could have helped your image', '2008-04-02 14:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4607313, 658967, 77838, '<td valign="top">What a great view!  Your angle makes the photo feel like it is tilted just a smidgen to the left; (maybe you could''ve rotated your image to the right a couple of degrees). -BB</td>', 'What a great view!  Your angle makes the photo feel like it is tilted just a smidgen to the left; (maybe you could''ve rotated your image to the right a couple of degrees). -BB', '2008-04-02 14:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4607318, 664433, 77838, '<td valign="top">Ooh, ahhh, ...I really like the black &amp; white here.  Course I love snowy mtns anytime of year!  Your border is complimentary too. -BB</td>', 'Ooh, ahhh, ...I really like the black & white here.  Course I love snowy mtns anytime of year!  Your border is complimentary too. -BB', '2008-04-02 14:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4607321, 663591, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, with a nice amount of details. Some of the edges look unnaturally sharp, especially the small offshoot of the branch just to the left of the bird.</td>', 'Pretty good, with a nice amount of details. Some of the edges look unnaturally sharp, especially the small offshoot of the branch just to the left of the bird.', '2008-04-02 14:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4607327, 663809, 77838, '<td valign="top">Your lighting setup here gives this a very dramatic feeling.  The ropes are kind of interesting also?.  It feels like the image was rotated but the plants say otherwise! -BB</td>', 'Your lighting setup here gives this a very dramatic feeling.  The ropes are kind of interesting also?.  It feels like the image was rotated but the plants say otherwise! -BB', '2008-04-02 14:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
