(4608598, 663768, 77838, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice framing.  The longer I stare at this picture the more it feels like he''s staring right back!<br/> <br/>I can just hear them talking. <br/>"But it''s fur looks so soft, Daddy, I want to touch it."<br/>"NO, it''ll eat you!"<br/>"Aw, let me pet the kitty cat."...<br/> <br/>...LOL! Sorry, forgive my blabbering. <br/> <br/>I do wish your framing was a little wider though.  So that you didn''t cut off his paws and the side of his mane.  Other than that great job. -BB</td>', 'Wow, nice framing.  The longer I stare at this picture the more it feels like he''s staring right back! I can just hear them talking. "But it''s fur looks so soft, Daddy, I want to touch it.""NO, it''ll eat you!""Aw, let me pet the kitty cat."... ...LOL! Sorry, forgive my blabbering.  I do wish your framing was a little wider though.  So that you didn''t cut off his paws and the side of his mane.  Other than that great job. -BB', '2008-04-02 20:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
