(4609382, 656276, 62006, '<td valign="top">Very cute portrait. I like the soft focus and lighting. Could be a little sharper focus but a good image overall.</td>', 'Very cute portrait. I like the soft focus and lighting. Could be a little sharper focus but a good image overall.', '2008-04-03 00:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609394, 664253, 62006, '<td valign="top">Great location and a fairly good shot. The strong light through the arches is actually a bit harsh for me. I would love to see other images of this place.</td>', 'Great location and a fairly good shot. The strong light through the arches is actually a bit harsh for me. I would love to see other images of this place.', '2008-04-03 00:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609402, 664424, 62006, '<td valign="top">Very nice silohette. Good capture of the sky, most of mine look blownout. Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice silohette. Good capture of the sky, most of mine look blownout. Good luck.', '2008-04-03 00:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609413, 662821, 62006, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location. I don''t know if it is my monitor or not but this has a blue tint throughout. Benefit of the doubt goes to you.</td>', 'Beautiful location. I don''t know if it is my monitor or not but this has a blue tint throughout. Benefit of the doubt goes to you.', '2008-04-03 00:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609420, 663792, 62006, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W. Nice contrast in the dark colors and an interesting subject. Looks like an old farm house which is a passion of mine. Is that a tin roof on the house? Good luck.</td>', 'Great B&W. Nice contrast in the dark colors and an interesting subject. Looks like an old farm house which is a passion of mine. Is that a tin roof on the house? Good luck.', '2008-04-03 00:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609426, 656600, 62006, '<td valign="top">Stunning capture. Very nice DOF and B&amp;W worked great for this.</td>', 'Stunning capture. Very nice DOF and B&W worked great for this.', '2008-04-03 00:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609498, 663893, 42495, '<td valign="top">Crown Point?</td>', 'Crown Point?', '2008-04-03 01:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609550, 663223, 19936, '<td valign="top">Exceptional!  Great light and intriguing pose.</td>', 'Exceptional!  Great light and intriguing pose.', '2008-04-03 01:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609571, 657808, 48389, '<td valign="top">The reflection is great here and your lighting is really nice. I like that you have everything in the image pin sharp but I am struggling to understand why you have posted such a small sized image? A larger sized shot would have made have helped this I think.<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'The reflection is great here and your lighting is really nice. I like that you have everything in the image pin sharp but I am struggling to understand why you have posted such a small sized image? A larger sized shot would have made have helped this I think. This is just my humble opinion.', '2008-04-03 01:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609596, 663079, 61863, '<td valign="top">The foreground is very distracting</td>', 'The foreground is very distracting', '2008-04-03 02:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
