(4609604, 660468, 61863, '<td valign="top">Focus DOF needs some work IMO to show off her pretty face to the full</td>', 'Focus DOF needs some work IMO to show off her pretty face to the full', '2008-04-03 02:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609606, 663868, 61863, '<td valign="top">A lot of empty space with little feature above the surfers to look at IMO</td>', 'A lot of empty space with little feature above the surfers to look at IMO', '2008-04-03 02:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609607, 663043, 48389, '<td valign="top">What were you thinking!?! LOL Only joking ;o) Love the choice of colours here and the composition is excellent. What a handsome chap this little fella is :o)</td>', 'What were you thinking!?! LOL Only joking ;o) Love the choice of colours here and the composition is excellent. What a handsome chap this little fella is :o)', '2008-04-03 02:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609608, 662424, 48389, '<td valign="top">Dear, dear dear...how many bird shots are there in this challenge?! ;o)<br/> <br/>Seriously, I think this is an excellent shot. I love the post processing and wonderful colour in the Owl''s eyes. I think the detail in the feathers around and just underneath the beak is very nice and the close up composition really makes this a captivating shot. I hope it does well for you :o)<br/> <br/>Note: I am not voting on this image.</td>', 'Dear, dear dear...how many bird shots are there in this challenge?! ;o) Seriously, I think this is an excellent shot. I love the post processing and wonderful colour in the Owl''s eyes. I think the detail in the feathers around and just underneath the beak is very nice and the close up composition really makes this a captivating shot. I hope it does well for you :o) Note: I am not voting on this image.', '2008-04-03 02:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609611, 655476, 48389, '<td valign="top">I love the intricate detail you can find in the centre of a flower! I would like to have seen more of the centre in focus and possibly a shallower DOF on the petals so the bad parts on the petals weren''t too noticeable.<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'I love the intricate detail you can find in the centre of a flower! I would like to have seen more of the centre in focus and possibly a shallower DOF on the petals so the bad parts on the petals weren''t too noticeable. This is just my humble opinion.', '2008-04-03 02:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609612, 661561, 61863, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped the slight distraction on the left and cropped the bottom of the photo up higher, try it - it worked for me, good shot though</td>', 'I would have cropped the slight distraction on the left and cropped the bottom of the photo up higher, try it - it worked for me, good shot though', '2008-04-03 02:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609613, 663532, 61863, '<td valign="top">Too "centred" IMO, perhaps put the B &amp; S bottom left and "bring up" the yellow on the bucket</td>', 'Too "centred" IMO, perhaps put the B & S bottom left and "bring up" the yellow on the bucket', '2008-04-03 02:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4609617, 664015, 48389, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and nice bokeh. To my eyes it doesn''t look like the Tigers eyes/face are pinsharp which, for me, would have added an extra point.<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion (and I am wearing my glasses!) :o)</td>', 'Lovely colours and nice bokeh. To my eyes it doesn''t look like the Tigers eyes/face are pinsharp which, for me, would have added an extra point. This is just my humble opinion (and I am wearing my glasses!) :o)', '2008-04-03 02:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
