(4610916, 661561, 84124, '<td valign="top">great symmetry to this shot, kind of makes me want to duck!</td>', 'great symmetry to this shot, kind of makes me want to duck!', '2008-04-03 13:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610933, 659185, 7786, '<td valign="top">Without the foreground trees it would have done much better. They are kinda blokking the interesting parts of this image.</td>', 'Without the foreground trees it would have done much better. They are kinda blokking the interesting parts of this image.', '2008-04-03 13:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610935, 657792, 84124, '<td valign="top">Hey <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=31637" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">RulerZigzag</a>, another great shot!  The sharp dropoff from dark to light adds a nice end of day mood to this one.  7.</td>', 'Hey  RulerZigzag, another great shot!  The sharp dropoff from dark to light adds a nice end of day mood to this one.  7.', '2008-04-03 13:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610936, 661744, 84124, '<td valign="top">Dramatic colors!  Very enjoyable to look at.</td>', 'Dramatic colors!  Very enjoyable to look at.', '2008-04-03 13:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610939, 664137, 7786, '<td valign="top">Yes, there sure are details to look at here. Well done.</td>', 'Yes, there sure are details to look at here. Well done.', '2008-04-03 13:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610940, 664375, 84124, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but I like "Hello there" more ;-)</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but I like "Hello there" more ;-)', '2008-04-03 13:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610942, 658046, 84124, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh, deserves a 7 for that.</td>', 'Made me laugh, deserves a 7 for that.', '2008-04-03 13:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610944, 662587, 7786, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and rarely seen subject here on DPC. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful and rarely seen subject here on DPC. Well done.', '2008-04-03 13:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610945, 661431, 7786, '<td valign="top">Overall and outstanding image. Well exposed and processed. I would have like though that people where placed on the right so that they would be looking through the image and not having the river valley behind their backs.</td>', 'Overall and outstanding image. Well exposed and processed. I would have like though that people where placed on the right so that they would be looking through the image and not having the river valley behind their backs.', '2008-04-03 13:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610946, 663349, 84124, '<td valign="top">Very intense.  Waxy chin and nose take a bit away from this shot, but overall it emotes a very eerie sense.  Might be a hair too much light on her face, but this is a fantastic shot.</td>', 'Very intense.  Waxy chin and nose take a bit away from this shot, but overall it emotes a very eerie sense.  Might be a hair too much light on her face, but this is a fantastic shot.', '2008-04-03 13:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610949, 664469, 84124, '<td valign="top">This would have been killer in environmental portrait!</td>', 'This would have been killer in environmental portrait!', '2008-04-03 13:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610950, 664197, 7786, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like the leading lines of the fence and the lone tree. I think actually that without the church the photo would have been even better.</td>', 'Well done. I like the leading lines of the fence and the lone tree. I think actually that without the church the photo would have been even better.', '2008-04-03 13:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610952, 656600, 84124, '<td valign="top">Oooooo... nice shot!  Even that ugly contrail adds to this shot, absolutely love it!  One of my favs so far.</td>', 'Oooooo... nice shot!  Even that ugly contrail adds to this shot, absolutely love it!  One of my favs so far.', '2008-04-03 13:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610961, 659509, 74534, '<td valign="top">I think some separation between the subject and the bird in the background would have helped. Bokeh does it somewhat, but is still makes the center a bit too busy.</td>', 'I think some separation between the subject and the bird in the background would have helped. Bokeh does it somewhat, but is still makes the center a bit too busy.', '2008-04-03 13:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610970, 664389, 74534, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve got the most out of this subject, with a good composition and very good B&amp;W. The background though (except for the sky) really doesn''t help, as it''s very uninteresting.</td>', 'I think you''ve got the most out of this subject, with a good composition and very good B&W. The background though (except for the sky) really doesn''t help, as it''s very uninteresting.', '2008-04-03 14:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610972, 655705, 74534, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea with the bus, two symbols of the city in one shot. I just feel you''ve left too much asphalt in.</td>', 'Excellent idea with the bus, two symbols of the city in one shot. I just feel you''ve left too much asphalt in.', '2008-04-03 14:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610974, 662361, 74534, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an alien look... Unfortunately lighting is kind of flat.</td>', 'Wow, what an alien look... Unfortunately lighting is kind of flat.', '2008-04-03 14:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4610979, 662859, 74534, '<td valign="top">It''s a gorgeous scene and well exposed, but the extreme aspect ratio does not help. I think a regular aspect ratio with some sort of foreground included as well would have been great.</td>', 'It''s a gorgeous scene and well exposed, but the extreme aspect ratio does not help. I think a regular aspect ratio with some sort of foreground included as well would have been great.', '2008-04-03 14:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611102, 662540, 22917, '<td valign="top">I like the spectacular sky here, but if possible it would have been nice to have some more detail in the foreground.</td>', 'I like the spectacular sky here, but if possible it would have been nice to have some more detail in the foreground.', '2008-04-03 15:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611103, 662587, 22917, '<td valign="top">Lovely</td>', 'Lovely', '2008-04-03 15:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611104, 661561, 22917, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed photo</td>', 'Nicely framed photo', '2008-04-03 15:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611110, 663713, 22917, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very nice black and white conversion too.</td>', 'Wow. Very nice black and white conversion too.', '2008-04-03 15:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611129, 664498, 22917, '<td valign="top">Great colours here, and a well-balanced shot.</td>', 'Great colours here, and a well-balanced shot.', '2008-04-03 15:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611159, 660383, 22917, '<td valign="top">Great photo, has the feeling of a painting.</td>', 'Great photo, has the feeling of a painting.', '2008-04-03 15:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611329, 660141, 92192, '<td valign="top">I love the different layers of colors.  I like the details in the front, middle and rear of the photo.</td>', 'I love the different layers of colors.  I like the details in the front, middle and rear of the photo.', '2008-04-03 16:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611397, 655476, 83845, '<td valign="top">there''s only a very small bit in focus... pretty colors</td>', 'there''s only a very small bit in focus... pretty colors', '2008-04-03 16:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611409, 664408, 41206, '<td valign="top">Someone''s been on a 3 mile hike (one way) into Cades Cove! lovely, a 6 . I too have photographed Abram''s Falls!!!!</td>', 'Someone''s been on a 3 mile hike (one way) into Cades Cove! lovely, a 6 . I too have photographed Abram''s Falls!!!!', '2008-04-03 16:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
