(4612040, 664242, 84124, '<td valign="top">Nice moment in time you''ve caught with this snapshot.  I can tell from the landscape this is far from New England, but this is all too common in summer time in this neck of the woods.</td>', 'Nice moment in time you''ve caught with this snapshot.  I can tell from the landscape this is far from New England, but this is all too common in summer time in this neck of the woods.', '2008-04-03 21:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
