(4612118, 664102, 74534, '<td valign="top">The moment was well captured and expressive, but the B&amp;W conversion lacks "impact".</td>', 'The moment was well captured and expressive, but the B&W conversion lacks "impact".', '2008-04-03 22:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612125, 664430, 74534, '<td valign="top">The foreground is a bit too busy - there is not enough tonal separation between the machines and the shadows behind them. Otherwise, good choice of subject, great sky and pleasing tones.</td>', 'The foreground is a bit too busy - there is not enough tonal separation between the machines and the shadows behind them. Otherwise, good choice of subject, great sky and pleasing tones.', '2008-04-03 22:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612132, 661948, 74534, '<td valign="top">The fact that part of the face is covered (including one eye) takes something away from the photo. Also, light was kind of flat, requiring more processing to bring out textures and increase the "impact" of the image...</td>', 'The fact that part of the face is covered (including one eye) takes something away from the photo. Also, light was kind of flat, requiring more processing to bring out textures and increase the "impact" of the image...', '2008-04-03 22:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612141, 664132, 74534, '<td valign="top">Looks slightly overexposed to me - I get those pale cyan colors in the sky myself all the time if I overexposed. and they''re hard to fix in processing. Foreground is a bit too high key as well - I guess it was because you tried to get some detail in the crater as well. Very hard lighting to get a photo in...</td>', 'Looks slightly overexposed to me - I get those pale cyan colors in the sky myself all the time if I overexposed. and they''re hard to fix in processing. Foreground is a bit too high key as well - I guess it was because you tried to get some detail in the crater as well. Very hard lighting to get a photo in...', '2008-04-03 22:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
