(4612424, 656293, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 8/6/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/7/7 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:6/6 <br/>Presentation: 6 <br/>Total: 6.4 <br/>Vote: 7 <br/> <br/>Remarks: I voted 7 instead of simply rounding the number, as I usually do. To my sense, the given aesthetics could be perceived as either <i>gorgeous</i> or <i>horrific</i> in a Hadean sort of way, but <i>stunning</i> in any case, which renders any specific value  entered here somewhat meaningless.<br/> <br/>Both the near-aerial perspective and grandiose manner appear to have been dictated by the monolithic mass of the central subject. Compositionally, the image is top-heavy -not a bad thing, perhaps, when the main POI is depicted as if floating on molten lava.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 8/6/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/7/7 Aesthetics/Technical:6/6 Presentation: 6 Total: 6.4 Vote: 7  Remarks: I voted 7 instead of simply rounding the number, as I usually do. To my sense, the given aesthetics could be perceived as either gorgeous or horrific in a Hadean sort of way, but stunning in any case, which renders any specific value  entered here somewhat meaningless. Both the near-aerial perspective and grandiose manner appear to have been dictated by the monolithic mass of the central subject. Compositionally, the image is top-heavy -not a bad thing, perhaps, when the main POI is depicted as if floating on molten lava.', '2008-04-04 00:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612425, 664398, 90495, '<td valign="top">Tip, try lighting your pet shots using no diffusion. Their coats will jump out at you and the highlights will give a beautiful shine to it as well.<br/> <br/>Good animal portrait. But I would''ve removed his collar.</td>', 'Tip, try lighting your pet shots using no diffusion. Their coats will jump out at you and the highlights will give a beautiful shine to it as well. Good animal portrait. But I would''ve removed his collar.', '2008-04-04 00:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612430, 663243, 90495, '<td valign="top">Great action capture. Looks like fun.</td>', 'Great action capture. Looks like fun.', '2008-04-04 00:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612507, 663642, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 6/6/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/7/6 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:8/7 <br/>Presentation: 6 <br/>Total: 6.4 <br/>Vote: 6 <br/> <br/>Remarks: An illustration, really, but a rare, magical one!</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 6/6/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/7/6 Aesthetics/Technical:8/7 Presentation: 6 Total: 6.4 Vote: 6  Remarks: An illustration, really, but a rare, magical one!', '2008-04-04 01:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
