(4612778, 656855, 48389, '<td valign="top">I am really not sure what this is. I like the light on the hair? but the rest of the image is quite unappealing and I am even more confused when I read your title.<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'I am really not sure what this is. I like the light on the hair? but the rest of the image is quite unappealing and I am even more confused when I read your title. This is just my humble opinion.', '2008-04-04 05:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
