(4612790, 660997, 66635, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Really really nice.  My one critique is that the clouds seem overly photoshopped.  Still a spectacular photo, though.  Montana?</td>', 'Wow!  Really really nice.  My one critique is that the clouds seem overly photoshopped.  Still a spectacular photo, though.  Montana?', '2008-04-04 05:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612791, 657737, 66635, '<td valign="top">Glorious!</td>', 'Glorious!', '2008-04-04 05:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612792, 663865, 48389, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea and nicely composed, however, I would like to have seen more of the foreground in focus so it was pulling me into the image. From what I can tell the point of focus is on the fair left and seems quite out of place there, a different point of focus and a little more of the foreground in focus would have made this image a lot better.<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'An interesting idea and nicely composed, however, I would like to have seen more of the foreground in focus so it was pulling me into the image. From what I can tell the point of focus is on the fair left and seems quite out of place there, a different point of focus and a little more of the foreground in focus would have made this image a lot better. This is just my humble opinion.', '2008-04-04 05:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612793, 663086, 48389, '<td valign="top">I think B&amp;W suits the subject but whatever other editing you have done here has actually made this shot quite unappealing. I''d like to have seen a lot more detail in the trees on the hill/mountain side and some detail in the foreground land.<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'I think B&W suits the subject but whatever other editing you have done here has actually made this shot quite unappealing. I''d like to have seen a lot more detail in the trees on the hill/mountain side and some detail in the foreground land. This is just my humble opinion.', '2008-04-04 05:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612794, 663698, 66635, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Love the perspective, mist and mood!</td>', 'Wonderful!  Love the perspective, mist and mood!', '2008-04-04 05:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612796, 662815, 66635, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot; but I think I''d prefer it without the pink.</td>', 'I like it a lot; but I think I''d prefer it without the pink.', '2008-04-04 05:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612797, 664445, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here. I enjoy abstract and minimilist images but with an image like this I am really looking to see the point of focus pin sharp and unfortunately this doesn''t deliver that. I do like the colours, are the edges added in your post processing or did it look like this when you took it? If I were to suggest any other improvement it would be to try and have the purple in the rule of thirds rather than almost in the centre of the frame.<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'I like the idea here. I enjoy abstract and minimilist images but with an image like this I am really looking to see the point of focus pin sharp and unfortunately this doesn''t deliver that. I do like the colours, are the edges added in your post processing or did it look like this when you took it? If I were to suggest any other improvement it would be to try and have the purple in the rule of thirds rather than almost in the centre of the frame. This is just my humble opinion.', '2008-04-04 05:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612798, 664283, 66635, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sharpness.  Beautifully done/</td>', 'Wonderful sharpness.  Beautifully done/', '2008-04-04 05:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612799, 663312, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tone you have used in this image and actually think the border works ok but I am finding it difficult to find a point of interest here. I think focus on a smaller area of the branches which includes 2 or 3 water drops with a very shallow DOF would make this a lot more interesting.<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'I like the sepia tone you have used in this image and actually think the border works ok but I am finding it difficult to find a point of interest here. I think focus on a smaller area of the branches which includes 2 or 3 water drops with a very shallow DOF would make this a lot more interesting. This is just my humble opinion.', '2008-04-04 05:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612800, 664192, 48389, '<td valign="top">Is this a crop of a much larger image? I am finding the image quality isn''t that great and I am struggling to find the point of focus in this image. I would have liked to see the eyes in focus and possibly more of a close up on the face so I could see some of the wonderful detail in the whiskers (are they whiskers?).<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'Is this a crop of a much larger image? I am finding the image quality isn''t that great and I am struggling to find the point of focus in this image. I would have liked to see the eyes in focus and possibly more of a close up on the face so I could see some of the wonderful detail in the whiskers (are they whiskers?). This is just my humble opinion.', '2008-04-04 05:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612801, 663929, 66635, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Wonderful sharpness.  There seems to be a brown color cast, though.</td>', 'Love it!  Wonderful sharpness.  There seems to be a brown color cast, though.', '2008-04-04 05:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612802, 662442, 48389, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid the only thing I think no matter how I look at this image is that whatever post processing you have done has totally ruined this shot. On a positive note I think this is quite nicely composed but apart form that the detail in the trees, barn and land is completely lost in the poor editing. I wish I could give you tips on how to process your images but I only know the basics, I hope someone else will be able to leave you a comment on how you might improve your post processing skills.<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'I''m afraid the only thing I think no matter how I look at this image is that whatever post processing you have done has totally ruined this shot. On a positive note I think this is quite nicely composed but apart form that the detail in the trees, barn and land is completely lost in the poor editing. I wish I could give you tips on how to process your images but I only know the basics, I hope someone else will be able to leave you a comment on how you might improve your post processing skills. This is just my humble opinion.', '2008-04-04 05:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612803, 662719, 66635, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Really nice.  Looks like a painting.</td>', 'Wow!  Really nice.  Looks like a painting.', '2008-04-04 05:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612804, 664227, 48389, '<td valign="top">I am struggling to understand why you have given this wonderful creature a purple cast? Although their are areas on the left handside of the image which are quite blown this could still have made a nice shot. I would like to have seen the focus on the big cats eyes and a much more natural colour to the overall shot. I do like the close up crop you have done, and if it weren''t for the purple ''tint'' I would have scored this a bit higher.<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'I am struggling to understand why you have given this wonderful creature a purple cast? Although their are areas on the left handside of the image which are quite blown this could still have made a nice shot. I would like to have seen the focus on the big cats eyes and a much more natural colour to the overall shot. I do like the close up crop you have done, and if it weren''t for the purple ''tint'' I would have scored this a bit higher. This is just my humble opinion.', '2008-04-04 05:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612805, 663053, 48389, '<td valign="top">I would be interested to know if this is an extreme crop of a much larger image? I am struggling to find any part of this im focus and the poor quality of the shot is very off putting. Also, did you add the border at the bottom? If so it really doesn''t add anything to this image.<br/> <br/>I do like the colours and it looks as though there was some really nice light on the background. I would have liked to see maybe a more close up shot of the lobely red leaves with a little of that nice lighting on them. But the biggest thing I would encourage you to look at is the quality of the image.<br/> <br/>This is just my humble opinion.</td>', 'I would be interested to know if this is an extreme crop of a much larger image? I am struggling to find any part of this im focus and the poor quality of the shot is very off putting. Also, did you add the border at the bottom? If so it really doesn''t add anything to this image. I do like the colours and it looks as though there was some really nice light on the background. I would have liked to see maybe a more close up shot of the lobely red leaves with a little of that nice lighting on them. But the biggest thing I would encourage you to look at is the quality of the image. This is just my humble opinion.', '2008-04-04 05:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612806, 661751, 66635, '<td valign="top">Love the composition.  The gold is a neat idea.</td>', 'Love the composition.  The gold is a neat idea.', '2008-04-04 05:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612807, 661854, 66635, '<td valign="top">I''m sure she''s delighted with this photo!</td>', 'I''m sure she''s delighted with this photo!', '2008-04-04 05:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612810, 660229, 66635, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  He''s looking right at you!  It''s one in a million.  I''m giving you a ten because it''s so great and so natural -- not overphotoshopped to death.</td>', 'Awesome shot!  He''s looking right at you!  It''s one in a million.  I''m giving you a ten because it''s so great and so natural -- not overphotoshopped to death.', '2008-04-04 05:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612811, 655461, 66635, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2008-04-04 05:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612812, 664245, 66635, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2008-04-04 05:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612814, 661742, 66635, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2008-04-04 05:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612816, 663053, 66635, '<td valign="top">Nice color!</td>', 'Nice color!', '2008-04-04 05:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612817, 658757, 66635, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting.', '2008-04-04 05:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612818, 664424, 66635, '<td valign="top">Nice moment.</td>', 'Nice moment.', '2008-04-04 05:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612819, 662424, 66635, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!  Love the colorful eyes against the white feathers and the sharpness and detail.  Great composition.</td>', 'Spectacular!  Love the colorful eyes against the white feathers and the sharpness and detail.  Great composition.', '2008-04-04 05:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612821, 655284, 66635, '<td valign="top">I like how there is lighting on all the edges and darkness in between - but often just enough light, even in the shadows, to make out a little detail.</td>', 'I like how there is lighting on all the edges and darkness in between - but often just enough light, even in the shadows, to make out a little detail.', '2008-04-04 05:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612822, 664264, 66635, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  Great color against the black.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  Great color against the black.', '2008-04-04 05:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612824, 664114, 66635, '<td valign="top">Nice.  But you would improve this by using a slightly deeper depth of field so as to bring the all-important eyes into focus instead of, or in addition to, the nose.</td>', 'Nice.  But you would improve this by using a slightly deeper depth of field so as to bring the all-important eyes into focus instead of, or in addition to, the nose.', '2008-04-04 05:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612825, 663809, 66635, '<td valign="top">Freaky idea!  Kind of Charles Atlas-ish.  Great lighting.  Well-done.</td>', 'Freaky idea!  Kind of Charles Atlas-ish.  Great lighting.  Well-done.', '2008-04-04 05:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612827, 663974, 66635, '<td valign="top">Really great!  Perfect lighting.  Great choice to use B&amp;W here.  Great mood.</td>', 'Really great!  Perfect lighting.  Great choice to use B&W here.  Great mood.', '2008-04-04 05:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612829, 662677, 66635, '<td valign="top">Really great.  The only thing I can think of that might have been better - might - would be if you waited one second later for a bit of smoke to come out of his mouth or nose.</td>', 'Really great.  The only thing I can think of that might have been better - might - would be if you waited one second later for a bit of smoke to come out of his mouth or nose.', '2008-04-04 05:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612830, 660383, 66635, '<td valign="top">Like a painting from an old master.</td>', 'Like a painting from an old master.', '2008-04-04 05:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612831, 663319, 66635, '<td valign="top">Must be an agility competition.  They are so much fun.  Love the intense look of anticipation in the dog.  He just can''t wait to explode into the ring and win the ribbon.  Great!</td>', 'Must be an agility competition.  They are so much fun.  Love the intense look of anticipation in the dog.  He just can''t wait to explode into the ring and win the ribbon.  Great!', '2008-04-04 06:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612833, 664434, 66635, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  I''m a bit distracted by whatever it is that is on that guy''s earlobe, though.  Is it an earring?  I can''t tell.  Great color in the bouquet and boutonnier.</td>', 'Great picture.  I''m a bit distracted by whatever it is that is on that guy''s earlobe, though.  Is it an earring?  I can''t tell.  Great color in the bouquet and boutonnier.', '2008-04-04 06:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612834, 661389, 66635, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2008-04-04 06:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612835, 664403, 66635, '<td valign="top">The portrait is well-done.  I just wish she would be more expressive.</td>', 'The portrait is well-done.  I just wish she would be more expressive.', '2008-04-04 06:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612836, 662442, 66635, '<td valign="top">Kind of cool, but I''m not sure I like the Post processing in this one.</td>', 'Kind of cool, but I''m not sure I like the Post processing in this one.', '2008-04-04 06:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612837, 662757, 66635, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2008-04-04 06:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
