(4612887, 658187, 66635, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''ve ever seen a better portrait of a child.  Deserves a ten for best of category.</td>', 'Not sure I''ve ever seen a better portrait of a child.  Deserves a ten for best of category.', '2008-04-04 06:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
