(4613857, 660130, 11854, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting, very emotive. He/she seems so distraught over being trapped. 10</td>', 'Fantastic lighting, very emotive. He/she seems so distraught over being trapped. 10', '2008-04-04 13:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
