(4615116, 663929, 39349, '<td valign="top">Magnificent capture! I can almost feel the softness of this birds feathers. Nice exposure capturing the highlights in the water without blowing them out. Perhaps a tad weighted on the left with composition but nothing to knock major points off for. Good luck with this beautiful capture!</td>', 'Magnificent capture! I can almost feel the softness of this birds feathers. Nice exposure capturing the highlights in the water without blowing them out. Perhaps a tad weighted on the left with composition but nothing to knock major points off for. Good luck with this beautiful capture!', '2008-04-05 03:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
