(4615146, 662002, 39349, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I would suggest a couple of things to make it a great shot. First shooting in midday sun, I would have converted this to b/w. Second crop WAY in on the tiger so he is the main and ONLY subject in the shot. The plants on the right really distract from this big cat. Good luck!</td>', 'Good shot, I would suggest a couple of things to make it a great shot. First shooting in midday sun, I would have converted this to b/w. Second crop WAY in on the tiger so he is the main and ONLY subject in the shot. The plants on the right really distract from this big cat. Good luck!', '2008-04-05 03:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
