(4616312, 663995, 53147, '<td valign="top">This shot intrigues me.  If it werent for the jet skier it would not do that as much for sure, but him in it makes me stay and let my eye wander around the image more.</td>', 'This shot intrigues me.  If it werent for the jet skier it would not do that as much for sure, but him in it makes me stay and let my eye wander around the image more.', '2008-04-05 13:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616315, 663734, 74534, '<td valign="top">It was a good idea to include some foreground in the image as it makes for an interesting composition. However, due to harsh lighting, this image was virtually impossible to expose correctly. Here, in order to have detail in the shadows, most of the sunny parts are overexposed.</td>', 'It was a good idea to include some foreground in the image as it makes for an interesting composition. However, due to harsh lighting, this image was virtually impossible to expose correctly. Here, in order to have detail in the shadows, most of the sunny parts are overexposed.', '2008-04-05 13:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
