(4617307, 656351, 31637, '<td valign="top">Mellow-dramatic lighting. Try with some better lighting, pose is nice though.</td>', 'Mellow-dramatic lighting. Try with some better lighting, pose is nice though.', '2008-04-05 23:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617308, 664441, 31637, '<td valign="top">Whoa, what is he eating !</td>', 'Whoa, what is he eating !', '2008-04-05 23:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617309, 655665, 31637, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, lighting is just enough!</td>', 'Nice shot, lighting is just enough!', '2008-04-05 23:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617323, 656600, 90495, '<td valign="top">Wonderful looking area you captured there. Love the sky and how it reflects off the lake. Good blacks and bright whites make this a very well done b&amp;w image.</td>', 'Wonderful looking area you captured there. Love the sky and how it reflects off the lake. Good blacks and bright whites make this a very well done b&w image.', '2008-04-05 23:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617324, 662878, 90495, '<td valign="top">Lots of b&amp;w shots in this challenge, which is a good thing. Good contrast and detail in this fiddle.</td>', 'Lots of b&w shots in this challenge, which is a good thing. Good contrast and detail in this fiddle.', '2008-04-05 23:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617327, 660628, 90495, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s a very interesting bridge to have around as a photographer. I keep thinking contrast, is there enough? Maybe not, but only in some areas.</td>', 'Wow that''s a very interesting bridge to have around as a photographer. I keep thinking contrast, is there enough? Maybe not, but only in some areas.', '2008-04-05 23:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617332, 655373, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept. Really like the lighting and choices of colors. All of the technicals look fine. The only nitpick is the table top surface. It has some spots which could be easily cloned out. Would''ve been great I think if the table surface was similar in color to the background. (comment, no vote)</td>', 'Very nice concept. Really like the lighting and choices of colors. All of the technicals look fine. The only nitpick is the table top surface. It has some spots which could be easily cloned out. Would''ve been great I think if the table surface was similar in color to the background. (comment, no vote)', '2008-04-05 23:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617339, 662587, 71244, '<td valign="top">wish i was there! great photo, thanks for the peek.</td>', 'wish i was there! great photo, thanks for the peek.', '2008-04-05 23:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617341, 663312, 71244, '<td valign="top">love that border. nicely applied.</td>', 'love that border. nicely applied.', '2008-04-05 23:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617355, 660468, 71244, '<td valign="top">beautiful light, just wish it wasn''t so soft.</td>', 'beautiful light, just wish it wasn''t so soft.', '2008-04-05 23:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617445, 664379, 70000, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and tones in this,</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and tones in this,', '2008-04-06 00:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617448, 664474, 70000, '<td valign="top">Cute and spontaneous, The colors seem a bit wonky on my monitor, this may have had more impact in BW</td>', 'Cute and spontaneous, The colors seem a bit wonky on my monitor, this may have had more impact in BW', '2008-04-06 00:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617453, 664386, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love the side lighting and warm tones in this. It is a different view of a zebra. I love the detail of the hair around its face, nice shot</td>', 'I love the side lighting and warm tones in this. It is a different view of a zebra. I love the detail of the hair around its face, nice shot', '2008-04-06 00:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617455, 663041, 70000, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl, but I feel like the focus in her eyes is just too soft. It needs to be sharpened up so that the sharpness matches her lips</td>', 'Beautiful girl, but I feel like the focus in her eyes is just too soft. It needs to be sharpened up so that the sharpness matches her lips', '2008-04-06 00:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617457, 663685, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is great! I like the lighting and depth of field and the moment you captured is awkward and interesting. Nice shot</td>', 'This is great! I like the lighting and depth of field and the moment you captured is awkward and interesting. Nice shot', '2008-04-06 00:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617461, 663349, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love this in black and white. Great lighting and dramatic sky</td>', 'I love this in black and white. Great lighting and dramatic sky', '2008-04-06 00:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617466, 660471, 70000, '<td valign="top">There are so many wonderful things going on in this image. The line of the railing takes you around the photo and the smooth gray tones really make the person smoking blend into the surroundings. Very interesting street shot.</td>', 'There are so many wonderful things going on in this image. The line of the railing takes you around the photo and the smooth gray tones really make the person smoking blend into the surroundings. Very interesting street shot.', '2008-04-06 00:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617471, 663698, 70000, '<td valign="top">Unique shot, nice framing</td>', 'Unique shot, nice framing', '2008-04-06 00:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617475, 662073, 70000, '<td valign="top">Haha this is cool! I like the contrast between the bright umbrellas and what looks like snow</td>', 'Haha this is cool! I like the contrast between the bright umbrellas and what looks like snow', '2008-04-06 00:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617482, 656247, 70000, '<td valign="top">Very blunt, upfront portrait. I like it a lot. The lighting accentuating the texture of his skin is awesome and the way it lights his eyes is really beautiful. This is so subtle in its emotion which makes an interesting contrast with how straightforward the framing, angle and lighting are. Fabulous, unique portrait</td>', 'Very blunt, upfront portrait. I like it a lot. The lighting accentuating the texture of his skin is awesome and the way it lights his eyes is really beautiful. This is so subtle in its emotion which makes an interesting contrast with how straightforward the framing, angle and lighting are. Fabulous, unique portrait', '2008-04-06 01:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617488, 664469, 70000, '<td valign="top">Interesting cropping choices. It gives you enough information without being completely titled by the sign. Nice environmental portrait</td>', 'Interesting cropping choices. It gives you enough information without being completely titled by the sign. Nice environmental portrait', '2008-04-06 01:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617493, 664475, 70000, '<td valign="top">How awesomely bizarre! Perfectly posed I love it. I don''t know what the white shower is in the background but this all flows very well and is very unique. Very cool</td>', 'How awesomely bizarre! Perfectly posed I love it. I don''t know what the white shower is in the background but this all flows very well and is very unique. Very cool', '2008-04-06 01:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617608, 663960, 5585, '<td valign="top">Wow..never thought I would see something different as this....a different Borealis Shot WTG</td>', 'Wow..never thought I would see something different as this....a different Borealis Shot WTG', '2008-04-06 02:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617662, 664468, 11078, '<td valign="top">pretty girl but harsh light she has lovely eyes</td>', 'pretty girl but harsh light she has lovely eyes', '2008-04-06 04:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617666, 663188, 11078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work I love this 3 dimensional feel to it and the stunning colours</td>', 'Beautiful work I love this 3 dimensional feel to it and the stunning colours', '2008-04-06 04:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617667, 664441, 11078, '<td valign="top">what a serious look <br/>Love it such a hard case shot</td>', 'what a serious look Love it such a hard case shot', '2008-04-06 04:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617672, 662715, 11078, '<td valign="top">awesome shot you must have a very patient kitty 10 from me</td>', 'awesome shot you must have a very patient kitty 10 from me', '2008-04-06 04:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617676, 664288, 11078, '<td valign="top">Nice image of the sea it looks very natural well done 9</td>', 'Nice image of the sea it looks very natural well done 9', '2008-04-06 04:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617679, 663002, 11078, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2008-04-06 04:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617680, 664430, 11078, '<td valign="top">A nice feel to this image nice work</td>', 'A nice feel to this image nice work', '2008-04-06 04:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617681, 664408, 11078, '<td valign="top">lovely image Beautiful place</td>', 'lovely image Beautiful place', '2008-04-06 04:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617682, 661948, 11078, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the lion</td>', 'Great detail on the lion', '2008-04-06 04:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617683, 660597, 11078, '<td valign="top">Pretty image I love the colours</td>', 'Pretty image I love the colours', '2008-04-06 04:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617685, 663349, 11078, '<td valign="top">I like this very much great use of lighting and the B/W works really well 9</td>', 'I like this very much great use of lighting and the B/W works really well 9', '2008-04-06 04:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617689, 660165, 11078, '<td valign="top">A great portrait lots of detail 9</td>', 'A great portrait lots of detail 9', '2008-04-06 04:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617781, 663867, 41357, '<td valign="top">that white spot above the boy''s head is distracting still a very nice photo -8</td>', 'that white spot above the boy''s head is distracting still a very nice photo -8', '2008-04-06 06:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617782, 663309, 41357, '<td valign="top">very nice composition -8</td>', 'very nice composition -8', '2008-04-06 06:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617791, 661723, 3087, '<td valign="top">The colour balance seems too cold, could do with warming up. The contrast of the green frog and the yellow and purple flower is very nice.</td>', 'The colour balance seems too cold, could do with warming up. The contrast of the green frog and the yellow and purple flower is very nice.', '2008-04-06 07:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617793, 664114, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up pet portrait. I lik the detail ion the fur around the nose.</td>', 'Nice close-up pet portrait. I lik the detail ion the fur around the nose.', '2008-04-06 07:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617794, 660141, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the transition from blue through green to orangey-yellow. Lots of contrast, lots of interesting details to look at.</td>', 'I like the transition from blue through green to orangey-yellow. Lots of contrast, lots of interesting details to look at.', '2008-04-06 07:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617795, 663612, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I like your side on viewpoint.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I like your side on viewpoint.', '2008-04-06 07:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617801, 663865, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an intriguing image of a peacock feather! Definitely not the usual cliched presentation; this is almost abstract and all about curves, lines and reflections! Lovely!</td>', 'Wow, what an intriguing image of a peacock feather! Definitely not the usual cliched presentation; this is almost abstract and all about curves, lines and reflections! Lovely!', '2008-04-06 07:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617802, 664365, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely clean image with nice contrast between butterfly and background.</td>', 'Lovely clean image with nice contrast between butterfly and background.', '2008-04-06 07:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617803, 663960, 3087, '<td valign="top">Funky.</td>', 'Funky.', '2008-04-06 07:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617804, 663254, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely clarity of detail.</td>', 'Lovely clarity of detail.', '2008-04-06 07:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617805, 661751, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the entire background, both beach and water, are one colour. But the saturation and tone of the colour seem just a step too unnatural for me.</td>', 'I like the way that the entire background, both beach and water, are one colour. But the saturation and tone of the colour seem just a step too unnatural for me.', '2008-04-06 07:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617806, 663797, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. I really love the high contrast and high saturation treatment and the top-down viewpoint. Lovely textures and so much to look at too.</td>', 'Great portrait. I really love the high contrast and high saturation treatment and the top-down viewpoint. Lovely textures and so much to look at too.', '2008-04-06 07:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617809, 661635, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and DOF choice. Lovely warm temperature.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and DOF choice. Lovely warm temperature.', '2008-04-06 07:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617810, 661752, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and spot-on composition. Serenity.</td>', 'Lovely light and spot-on composition. Serenity.', '2008-04-06 07:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617811, 661561, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint for the landing of such an impressive creature. Was it coming to land on a post just behind you?</td>', 'Great viewpoint for the landing of such an impressive creature. Was it coming to land on a post just behind you?', '2008-04-06 07:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617814, 660383, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, nice pose and I like the colours, light and shade of the background too.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, nice pose and I like the colours, light and shade of the background too.', '2008-04-06 07:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617817, 659212, 3087, '<td valign="top">So many hummingbird shots are, for me, let down by the inclusion of unattractive plastic bird feeders. I love the way your shot has a hummingbird feeding at real and beautiful flowers. The colours are lovely as is the uncluttered beige of the background.</td>', 'So many hummingbird shots are, for me, let down by the inclusion of unattractive plastic bird feeders. I love the way your shot has a hummingbird feeding at real and beautiful flowers. The colours are lovely as is the uncluttered beige of the background.', '2008-04-06 07:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617819, 664464, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet seasonal study.</td>', 'Sweet seasonal study.', '2008-04-06 07:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617832, 662890, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh, I like this a lot. The blues and pinks. The way the pattern of the drain grate is echoed in the lines of the building reflection that crosses it. The lines of the paving slabs. This is great!</td>', 'Oooh, I like this a lot. The blues and pinks. The way the pattern of the drain grate is echoed in the lines of the building reflection that crosses it. The lines of the paving slabs. This is great!', '2008-04-06 07:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617836, 663631, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this. The horizontal haze lines and the single tanker silhouette within are nicely balanced by the dark line of the hills and the fluffy clouds.</td>', 'I like this. The horizontal haze lines and the single tanker silhouette within are nicely balanced by the dark line of the hills and the fluffy clouds.', '2008-04-06 07:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617838, 664420, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours. I love the red tinges on the blues of the ice. The two rays coming from the sun are great. Composition works well.</td>', 'Lovely colours. I love the red tinges on the blues of the ice. The two rays coming from the sun are great. Composition works well.', '2008-04-06 07:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617839, 664245, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, great job focusing atention on those gorgeous eyes! Very sweet portrait!</td>', 'Wow, great job focusing atention on those gorgeous eyes! Very sweet portrait!', '2008-04-06 07:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617841, 656627, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh, high key! Fabulous composition and I love the shallow DOF which makes the nose and mouth just suggestions of shapes. Great job.</td>', 'Oooh, high key! Fabulous composition and I love the shallow DOF which makes the nose and mouth just suggestions of shapes. Great job.', '2008-04-06 07:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617843, 655705, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the combination of red London bus and the iconic clock tower.</td>', 'I like the combination of red London bus and the iconic clock tower.', '2008-04-06 07:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617845, 664481, 3087, '<td valign="top">Really like the pose, clothing, make-up etc of the model and balloons but I find the environment behind particularly mundane - unattractive and cluttered rooftops and buildings.</td>', 'Really like the pose, clothing, make-up etc of the model and balloons but I find the environment behind particularly mundane - unattractive and cluttered rooftops and buildings.', '2008-04-06 07:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617846, 663642, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Great composition with no clutter. Perfect shallow DOF but lots of details in the eyes and fur. Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely! Great composition with no clutter. Perfect shallow DOF but lots of details in the eyes and fur. Lovely.', '2008-04-06 07:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617854, 663023, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s some cloud you''ve captured there. I like the way that, even when we''re clearly looking at at some rain coming down the overall image is blue and sunny with those gorgeous yellow flowers across the scene.</td>', 'Wow, that''s some cloud you''ve captured there. I like the way that, even when we''re clearly looking at at some rain coming down the overall image is blue and sunny with those gorgeous yellow flowers across the scene.', '2008-04-06 07:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617885, 664498, 23430, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and the composition of this one. Light seems on the wrong side though which is putting his head in the shade.</td>', 'I like the colours and the composition of this one. Light seems on the wrong side though which is putting his head in the shade.', '2008-04-06 08:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617966, 664481, 55838, '<td valign="top">What a fun quirky shot!  My eyes would like to see less space on the left and more on the right to match the "direction" she seems to be going but who knows.  Very cute. 8</td>', 'What a fun quirky shot!  My eyes would like to see less space on the left and more on the right to match the "direction" she seems to be going but who knows.  Very cute. 8', '2008-04-06 09:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617968, 664460, 55838, '<td valign="top">BAHAHAHA!!!  This is hilarious!  Extra point for making me laugh. 7</td>', 'BAHAHAHA!!!  This is hilarious!  Extra point for making me laugh. 7', '2008-04-06 09:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617984, 664443, 55838, '<td valign="top">Such a cool shot.  Well edited and interesting composition.  Nicely done. 8</td>', 'Such a cool shot.  Well edited and interesting composition.  Nicely done. 8', '2008-04-06 09:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617986, 664275, 70270, '<td valign="top">You get an extra point for the title.  :&gt;P  Great bokeh</td>', 'You get an extra point for the title.  :>P  Great bokeh', '2008-04-06 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617988, 655705, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great colors &amp; blur. 8</td>', 'Great colors & blur. 8', '2008-04-06 09:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617996, 660471, 55838, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fabulous get-away-from-it-all hotel!  : )  Great location and a very interesting shot.  My eyes would like a heavier contrasty editing style on this shot but very nice as is.  8</td>', 'Looks like a fabulous get-away-from-it-all hotel!  : )  Great location and a very interesting shot.  My eyes would like a heavier contrasty editing style on this shot but very nice as is.  8', '2008-04-06 10:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618001, 659393, 70270, '<td valign="top">This is really freaky.  Reminds me of an old B-movie horror flick, with the harsh light on the cheek, the eeirie eyes and the long lashes.  Assuming that was the look you were going for, nice work!</td>', 'This is really freaky.  Reminds me of an old B-movie horror flick, with the harsh light on the cheek, the eeirie eyes and the long lashes.  Assuming that was the look you were going for, nice work!', '2008-04-06 10:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618044, 661723, 72318, '<td valign="top">I was eating my breakfast whilst going through voting and my jaw involuntarily stopped... I think that is all i really need to say!</td>', 'I was eating my breakfast whilst going through voting and my jaw involuntarily stopped... I think that is all i really need to say!', '2008-04-06 10:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618067, 663646, 72318, '<td valign="top">Might be harsh of me to say - but because you have/had natures best display at your disposal i find it difficult to judge these photos, and thus looking at the points of interest, the aruroa is fine, if a little grainy, the landscape is fine, if a little dark, and the light from the houses is blown and it seems as if you tried to rescue that and the attempt bled into the sky...  So i feel let down really...  HDR is in the rules these days for a reason. And even if you dont have true hdr capabilities, i''m fairly sure you will have the ability to mask layers... Compositionally this is a nice shot tho :)</td>', 'Might be harsh of me to say - but because you have/had natures best display at your disposal i find it difficult to judge these photos, and thus looking at the points of interest, the aruroa is fine, if a little grainy, the landscape is fine, if a little dark, and the light from the houses is blown and it seems as if you tried to rescue that and the attempt bled into the sky...  So i feel let down really...  HDR is in the rules these days for a reason. And even if you dont have true hdr capabilities, i''m fairly sure you will have the ability to mask layers... Compositionally this is a nice shot tho :)', '2008-04-06 10:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618072, 660197, 72318, '<td valign="top">Let me guess - you are an employee of a falconry or mates with one?  Looks like a night shot with a large diffused flash.  No matter - amazing shot!  :)</td>', 'Let me guess - you are an employee of a falconry or mates with one?  Looks like a night shot with a large diffused flash.  No matter - amazing shot!  :)', '2008-04-06 10:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618079, 664466, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice to use sepia.  Can''t quite see what''s in the water and what I can see of the buildings looks like they could have been around for 10 years or 100, which makes this somewhat timeless.  The dark clouds in the sky add a broody feeling.</td>', 'Interesting choice to use sepia.  Can''t quite see what''s in the water and what I can see of the buildings looks like they could have been around for 10 years or 100, which makes this somewhat timeless.  The dark clouds in the sky add a broody feeling.', '2008-04-06 10:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618080, 664154, 72318, '<td valign="top">might have looked better with the water stopped in motion... imo ;)</td>', 'might have looked better with the water stopped in motion... imo ;)', '2008-04-06 10:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618096, 663768, 72318, '<td valign="top">looks like you were shooting through glass - there is a bluish tint to his face and any highlights :(</td>', 'looks like you were shooting through glass - there is a bluish tint to his face and any highlights :(', '2008-04-06 10:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618099, 664472, 65234, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the new leaves and last year''s withered ones is nice.  The light seems a bit harsh for a spring shot (I tend to think of spring as a soft season), and what appears to be a heavily shadowed rock in the back looks almost foreboding, which again detracts from the new life sort of feeling I expect from this kind of shot.</td>', 'The contrast between the new leaves and last year''s withered ones is nice.  The light seems a bit harsh for a spring shot (I tend to think of spring as a soft season), and what appears to be a heavily shadowed rock in the back looks almost foreboding, which again detracts from the new life sort of feeling I expect from this kind of shot.', '2008-04-06 10:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618104, 664398, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely posed!  The background is highly complementary with the blue collar.</td>', 'Nicely posed!  The background is highly complementary with the blue collar.', '2008-04-06 10:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618107, 664462, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and sharpness.</td>', 'Nice colors and sharpness.', '2008-04-06 10:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618111, 664419, 72318, '<td valign="top">That had to have been a messy shoot! :D  The shaft seems a bit weird and there seems to be a bit of overprocessing going on but i cant put my finger on it. Watch jaggies on the shaft as well ;) If this was based on concept and effort/timing you would do amazingly well - nice compo too :)</td>', 'That had to have been a messy shoot! :D  The shaft seems a bit weird and there seems to be a bit of overprocessing going on but i cant put my finger on it. Watch jaggies on the shaft as well ;) If this was based on concept and effort/timing you would do amazingly well - nice compo too :)', '2008-04-06 10:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618115, 664501, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what to make of this ... what it was that you wanted to show me.  Personally, I find the shot more intriguing if the big trees are cropped out from the leaves up, which also breaks the road, water and sky/mountains into more of a rule of thirds layout.  Then it makes me start imaging a Loch Ness monster out there in the foggy lake.</td>', 'Not quite sure what to make of this ... what it was that you wanted to show me.  Personally, I find the shot more intriguing if the big trees are cropped out from the leaves up, which also breaks the road, water and sky/mountains into more of a rule of thirds layout.  Then it makes me start imaging a Loch Ness monster out there in the foggy lake.', '2008-04-06 10:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618120, 655985, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ick.  Bird is quite sharp and colors are nice; I would dodge the bird considerably more to make it stand out better from the background.</td>', 'Ick.  Bird is quite sharp and colors are nice; I would dodge the bird considerably more to make it stand out better from the background.', '2008-04-06 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618125, 658213, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting and thought-provoking, especially with that title.</td>', 'Interesting and thought-provoking, especially with that title.', '2008-04-06 11:01:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4618132, 662360, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely tulip.  Would like the one in back to be a bit less bright, I think, though it echoes the lighting and shape of the foreground flower there''s a bit that looks totally blown on my monitor and that pulls my eye rather strongly.</td>', 'Lovely tulip.  Would like the one in back to be a bit less bright, I think, though it echoes the lighting and shape of the foreground flower there''s a bit that looks totally blown on my monitor and that pulls my eye rather strongly.', '2008-04-06 11:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618138, 663351, 65234, '<td valign="top">The birds look interesting (is that really all tail?) but are not standing out well from the background to my eye.  The detail on the twigs and leaves makes the shot feel very busy to me.</td>', 'The birds look interesting (is that really all tail?) but are not standing out well from the background to my eye.  The detail on the twigs and leaves makes the shot feel very busy to me.', '2008-04-06 11:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618152, 661751, 65234, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice and I like the gold tones; there is a bit of haloing around the pink shirt ... I might have colored it gold and let her blend into the moment more.</td>', 'The composition is nice and I like the gold tones; there is a bit of haloing around the pink shirt ... I might have colored it gold and let her blend into the moment more.', '2008-04-06 11:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618162, 656049, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  Looks like some sort of aliens with nasty sharp spiky bits.  And no eyes, so they must be indiscriminately eating whatever''s in reach.  <br/> <br/>Scary =:-O</td>', 'Yikes!  Looks like some sort of aliens with nasty sharp spiky bits.  And no eyes, so they must be indiscriminately eating whatever''s in reach.   Scary =:-O', '2008-04-06 11:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618165, 663463, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, pretty :-)  I have a Star Magnolia just going out of bllom now, and have taken many pictures of the fuzzy buds progressing to flowers.  Nice subject for this time of year (in my part of the world, anyway).</td>', 'Oh, pretty :-)  I have a Star Magnolia just going out of bllom now, and have taken many pictures of the fuzzy buds progressing to flowers.  Nice subject for this time of year (in my part of the world, anyway).', '2008-04-06 11:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618170, 663874, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition (though a little tight on the left); would be even more fun if the lion was spitting/spewing water.</td>', 'Nice composition (though a little tight on the left); would be even more fun if the lion was spitting/spewing water.', '2008-04-06 11:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618174, 664497, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cuteness :-)  Would like to have seen a catchlight in his/her little eye.  Might have needed a different angle or for baby to turn his/her head slightly to get that.  Probably not a cooperative model, though.</td>', 'Cuteness :-)  Would like to have seen a catchlight in his/her little eye.  Might have needed a different angle or for baby to turn his/her head slightly to get that.  Probably not a cooperative model, though.', '2008-04-06 11:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618180, 664105, 4517, '<td valign="top">Looked just like this here today.</td>', 'Looked just like this here today.', '2008-04-06 11:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618185, 664102, 65234, '<td valign="top">Won''t do what?  Title is befuddling me but maybe I need more coffee this morning.  Looks like a cold day at the market but I bet those peas are sweet.  Interesting to me that the seller has what appear to be nice rings on.  Around here they like to remind us they are farmers and prefer we think of them as poor ones!</td>', 'Won''t do what?  Title is befuddling me but maybe I need more coffee this morning.  Looks like a cold day at the market but I bet those peas are sweet.  Interesting to me that the seller has what appear to be nice rings on.  Around here they like to remind us they are farmers and prefer we think of them as poor ones!', '2008-04-06 11:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618186, 662369, 4517, '<td valign="top">Could be sharpened up a touch.</td>', 'Could be sharpened up a touch.', '2008-04-06 11:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618188, 663542, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen one; lovely!  Looks like it was sprinkled with fairy dust.</td>', 'I''ve never seen one; lovely!  Looks like it was sprinkled with fairy dust.', '2008-04-06 11:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618190, 662587, 4517, '<td valign="top">Excellent 9</td>', 'Excellent 9', '2008-04-06 11:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618225, 658213, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2008-04-06 11:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618230, 655935, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, The sun rays are cool they enhance the image.</td>', 'Nice capture, The sun rays are cool they enhance the image.', '2008-04-06 11:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618231, 659154, 41206, '<td valign="top">I have only voted 10 on two entries, this is one of them, GREAT image!!!</td>', 'I have only voted 10 on two entries, this is one of them, GREAT image!!!', '2008-04-06 11:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
