(4618862, 663727, 68035, '<td valign="top">Fantastic atmospheric image.  I love the way that you have frame the boat at sea on the left and right with man made objects and to the top with low clouds.  The clouds themselves add a great natural vignette to the shot which really draw the eye to the subjects.<br/> <br/>The colouring is sublime and has be scratching my head somewhat as it almost looks sepia but their are glorious hints of very gentle pastel colours (on the buoys and the bin by the hut on the right)<br/> <br/>Beautiful and mystic 8</td>', 'Fantastic atmospheric image.  I love the way that you have frame the boat at sea on the left and right with man made objects and to the top with low clouds.  The clouds themselves add a great natural vignette to the shot which really draw the eye to the subjects. The colouring is sublime and has be scratching my head somewhat as it almost looks sepia but their are glorious hints of very gentle pastel colours (on the buoys and the bin by the hut on the right) Beautiful and mystic 8', '2008-04-06 18:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
