(4619066, 661948, 73250, '<td valign="top">Gives the feeling of actually being in the wild. Nicely seen.</td>', 'Gives the feeling of actually being in the wild. Nicely seen.', '2008-04-06 20:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619074, 661718, 73250, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture...wonderful day for them! I''m not going to vote this one, since I know who took it! What fun!</td>', 'Lovely capture...wonderful day for them! I''m not going to vote this one, since I know who took it! What fun!', '2008-04-06 20:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619082, 664375, 69246, '<td valign="top">First star to the right...and straight on ''til morning. I love this shot. Very nicely composed, great feeling and bond between father and daughter. This photo has the right amount of positive foreground, and the perfect amount of negative background space.</td>', 'First star to the right...and straight on ''til morning. I love this shot. Very nicely composed, great feeling and bond between father and daughter. This photo has the right amount of positive foreground, and the perfect amount of negative background space.', '2008-04-06 20:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619085, 664409, 90495, '<td valign="top">I like this, very neat and clear. The bg is superb with the difference in tone at the corners. Lovely capture.</td>', 'I like this, very neat and clear. The bg is superb with the difference in tone at the corners. Lovely capture.', '2008-04-06 20:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619089, 658187, 69246, '<td valign="top">Hmm..remarkably similar subject to "Daddy &amp; Me...Straight On ''til Morning". Perhaps both parents are on DPC?  I''m curious now. Good shot.</td>', 'Hmm..remarkably similar subject to "Daddy & Me...Straight On ''til Morning". Perhaps both parents are on DPC?  I''m curious now. Good shot.', '2008-04-06 20:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619094, 663423, 69246, '<td valign="top">Normally, I''d like to see more of the temple exposed. But in this case, you nailed the exposure. Nice shot!</td>', 'Normally, I''d like to see more of the temple exposed. But in this case, you nailed the exposure. Nice shot!', '2008-04-06 21:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619099, 662815, 9462, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation seems unnecessary.</td>', 'The selective desaturation seems unnecessary.', '2008-04-06 21:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619105, 663780, 90495, '<td valign="top">Although I like this shot a lot I have to point out a couple things. The left side tree line is completely black except for a couple spots of light, no details. Was this intentional, I don''t know. I don''t know what your ps skills are but a little burning in in the clouds and sky would''ve greatly improved this image. Love the reflections. I would''ve cloned out that post/stick in the middle of the lake, once I spotted it I kept going back to it.</td>', 'Although I like this shot a lot I have to point out a couple things. The left side tree line is completely black except for a couple spots of light, no details. Was this intentional, I don''t know. I don''t know what your ps skills are but a little burning in in the clouds and sky would''ve greatly improved this image. Love the reflections. I would''ve cloned out that post/stick in the middle of the lake, once I spotted it I kept going back to it.', '2008-04-06 21:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619116, 664382, 9462, '<td valign="top">It would be more appealing to backlight this, allowing for more depth. The glare is uninviting and your focus is soft.</td>', 'It would be more appealing to backlight this, allowing for more depth. The glare is uninviting and your focus is soft.', '2008-04-06 21:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619126, 662360, 90495, '<td valign="top">Love the translucence in the petals. Good comp and crop. Bad border or I would have made it thinner.</td>', 'Love the translucence in the petals. Good comp and crop. Bad border or I would have made it thinner.', '2008-04-06 21:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619130, 660597, 90495, '<td valign="top">Wow nice painting. It really looks like one. The more I view, the more I like.<br/>Splendido!<br/>Faved!</td>', 'Wow nice painting. It really looks like one. The more I view, the more I like.Splendido!Faved!', '2008-04-06 21:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619134, 664282, 90495, '<td valign="top">Buy that dog a steak for crying out loud! You can see his ribs, poor thing. I would have liked to see his eyes more but a fine pic.</td>', 'Buy that dog a steak for crying out loud! You can see his ribs, poor thing. I would have liked to see his eyes more but a fine pic.', '2008-04-06 21:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619136, 662059, 90495, '<td valign="top">What are they watching? Good capture.</td>', 'What are they watching? Good capture.', '2008-04-06 21:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619224, 656319, 69246, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to see how many overlays you did. ;) Good shot. Knowing how hard these are to get...I''m giving a high score. Most can''t appreciate the difficulty in this shot. Just curious if you used photoshop for stacking or another astro software package.</td>', 'Can''t wait to see how many overlays you did. ;) Good shot. Knowing how hard these are to get...I''m giving a high score. Most can''t appreciate the difficulty in this shot. Just curious if you used photoshop for stacking or another astro software package.', '2008-04-06 22:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619231, 664453, 88575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rare shot!</td>', 'Beautiful rare shot!', '2008-04-06 22:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619232, 657035, 88575, '<td valign="top">What an interesting and unusual perspective.  Lovely!</td>', 'What an interesting and unusual perspective.  Lovely!', '2008-04-06 22:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
