(4619239, 660013, 88575, '<td valign="top">Wow, it''s hard to realize there is a whole world out there we can''t see.  This is great.</td>', 'Wow, it''s hard to realize there is a whole world out there we can''t see.  This is great.', '2008-04-06 22:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
