(4619963, 664220, 5391, '<td valign="top">This automatically made me smile.  Beautiful tonal range, and it seems to lead you into a very private, intimate moment with this person.  Something very special in this image that just completely comes together...  Beautiful.  10</td>', 'This automatically made me smile.  Beautiful tonal range, and it seems to lead you into a very private, intimate moment with this person.  Something very special in this image that just completely comes together...  Beautiful.  10', '2008-04-07 02:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
