(4620412, 656319, 48471, '<td valign="top">There''s not much to say for these kind of images, because technicalities go beyond standard photography and the art here is more in the thought and contemplation, rather than in aesthetic rationalities. Now you made me want to go and browse your portfolio so that I can escape into Universe. I''ll do just that.</td>', 'There''s not much to say for these kind of images, because technicalities go beyond standard photography and the art here is more in the thought and contemplation, rather than in aesthetic rationalities. Now you made me want to go and browse your portfolio so that I can escape into Universe. I''ll do just that.', '2008-04-07 09:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620688, 664331, 42495, '<td valign="top">I really like what you''ve done here and the B&amp;W conversion is fantastic.  There''s a story to be told here and this makes me want to learn what it is.  What''s holding me back from giving a higher score is the arrangement of items, somehow it looks as if they were placed there for the picture, as opposed to the photographer capturing the scene as it unfolded. 6</td>', 'I really like what you''ve done here and the B&W conversion is fantastic.  There''s a story to be told here and this makes me want to learn what it is.  What''s holding me back from giving a higher score is the arrangement of items, somehow it looks as if they were placed there for the picture, as opposed to the photographer capturing the scene as it unfolded. 6', '2008-04-07 10:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
