(4621550, 659212, 67258, '<td valign="top">My instant rection to this, despite having seen umpteen dozen other humming bird photos, was "Oh WOW".  This is seriously impressive, especially to a European who has never seen a hunimg bird in the flesh.  Excellent work.</td>', 'My instant rection to this, despite having seen umpteen dozen other humming bird photos, was "Oh WOW".  This is seriously impressive, especially to a European who has never seen a hunimg bird in the flesh.  Excellent work.', '2008-04-07 17:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
