(4621739, 662594, 22970, '<td valign="top">Hard to see the details with your picture being small vertically. Not sure if the tone matches the subject. I would of liked to have seen more, it feels as if I''m missing something at the bottom of the picture.<br/>Wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'Hard to see the details with your picture being small vertically. Not sure if the tone matches the subject. I would of liked to have seen more, it feels as if I''m missing something at the bottom of the picture.Wish you well in the challenge.', '2008-04-07 18:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
