(4621752, 656600, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. The left bottom 1/3rd of your picture shows intensity while the remaining photo seems so surreal with glassy water, wind blown clouds in the sky. Great job of capturing both motion and stillness. I like the processing as well - nice B&amp;W. 9</td>', 'Nice perspective. The left bottom 1/3rd of your picture shows intensity while the remaining photo seems so surreal with glassy water, wind blown clouds in the sky. Great job of capturing both motion and stillness. I like the processing as well - nice B&W. 9', '2008-04-07 18:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
