(4622026, 655771, 50695, '<td valign="top">a real visual treat, with the high tones living so comfortably with the blacks. Interesting flickers of positive and negative space occur. and then after a while one remembers that he is looking at a being, a creature, somebody who is looking back.</td>', 'a real visual treat, with the high tones living so comfortably with the blacks. Interesting flickers of positive and negative space occur. and then after a while one remembers that he is looking at a being, a creature, somebody who is looking back.', '2008-04-07 21:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
