(4622563, 664403, 77838, '<td valign="top">Awesome coloring.  Her jaw is sticking out plenty far, almost too far but I really like her expression here though.  The little jewels at her eyes compliment the pendant of her necklace. -BB</td>', 'Awesome coloring.  Her jaw is sticking out plenty far, almost too far but I really like her expression here though.  The little jewels at her eyes compliment the pendant of her necklace. -BB', '2008-04-08 00:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
