(4622569, 664453, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see it cropped a little lower to get the front legs in the shot.  The yellow foliage is too bright compared to the dark bison.  This has a lot of potential with a slightly different crop on some PP work.</td>', 'I''d like to see it cropped a little lower to get the front legs in the shot.  The yellow foliage is too bright compared to the dark bison.  This has a lot of potential with a slightly different crop on some PP work.', '2008-04-08 00:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4622570, 664481, 77838, '<td valign="top">Wow, great expression with the matching B&amp;W dress vs. ballons.  + the fact that the dots are round like the balloons.  Yes, I know, stating the obvious! Almost feels a little like Mary Poppins except with balloons instead of an umbrella.<br/> <br/>The "high feeling" that I get with this POV is great.  She feels so high above the city, high above her troubles; just floating away. Cool shot. -BB</td>', 'Wow, great expression with the matching B&W dress vs. ballons.  + the fact that the dots are round like the balloons.  Yes, I know, stating the obvious! Almost feels a little like Mary Poppins except with balloons instead of an umbrella. The "high feeling" that I get with this POV is great.  She feels so high above the city, high above her troubles; just floating away. Cool shot. -BB', '2008-04-08 00:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
