(4622775, 663642, 56880, '<td valign="top">Looks like I owe you 10 comments for winning our Free Study side challenge.  Your DOF here is perfect, and I really like the 3 bands of color further framing the rabbits.  The solid blur in the extreme forground it a bit distracting; for whatever reason I like background bokeh more than foreground bokeh.</td>', 'Looks like I owe you 10 comments for winning our Free Study side challenge.  Your DOF here is perfect, and I really like the 3 bands of color further framing the rabbits.  The solid blur in the extreme forground it a bit distracting; for whatever reason I like background bokeh more than foreground bokeh.', '2008-04-08 01:28:23.000000', NULL, 0),
