(4622835, 663658, 25355, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a spacious place; that it, it seems less clutttered than a lot of cathedrals.</td>', 'That''s quite a spacious place; that it, it seems less clutttered than a lot of cathedrals.', '2008-04-08 01:55:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622836, 662403, 25355, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot; it''s good that they actually aloow you to use a tripod in there.</td>', 'Very nice shot; it''s good that they actually aloow you to use a tripod in there.', '2008-04-08 01:56:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622838, 661116, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hi Jackson.  Well, as the comments indicate, it is very dark.  Perhaps it shows differently on your monitor.  Get a print made and you''ll see what others see, and then you''ll probably agree that it''s too dark.  I think a lot could be improved with adding off-camera flash lighting, but it would be hard to do well without destroying the dark streetlight character of this truck, which is very nice.  I can see why you like it as it is.  Composition may be improved with a wider lens to get a more dynamic angle on the truck without losing the nice colours in the sky.  I like the contrast between the cool background and the warmer foreground lighting.  But as was said before, I think the only reason you didn''t score better is that it is so dark, and the truck is lost in the contrast.</td>', 'Hi Jackson.  Well, as the comments indicate, it is very dark.  Perhaps it shows differently on your monitor.  Get a print made and you''ll see what others see, and then you''ll probably agree that it''s too dark.  I think a lot could be improved with adding off-camera flash lighting, but it would be hard to do well without destroying the dark streetlight character of this truck, which is very nice.  I can see why you like it as it is.  Composition may be improved with a wider lens to get a more dynamic angle on the truck without losing the nice colours in the sky.  I like the contrast between the cool background and the warmer foreground lighting.  But as was said before, I think the only reason you didn''t score better is that it is so dark, and the truck is lost in the contrast.', '2008-04-08 01:58:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622840, 662758, 25355, '<td valign="top">It''s a great aurora, which probably explains it''s relatively high score despite the camera shake, eh. <br/>  How often do you get to see the aurora? And loons? I''ve always wanted to see a loon in the wild, since I had a Canadian teacher in sixth grade.</td>', 'It''s a great aurora, which probably explains it''s relatively high score despite the camera shake, eh.   How often do you get to see the aurora? And loons? I''ve always wanted to see a loon in the wild, since I had a Canadian teacher in sixth grade.', '2008-04-08 02:00:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622842, 656600, 42013, '<td valign="top">Totally detailed! Your BW conversion is great.</td>', 'Totally detailed! Your BW conversion is great.', '2008-04-08 02:02:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622843, 659229, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hi Brandon,  I think your lighting and colours are really good.  With advanced editing, you could certainly do a little dodging/burning to drop the background and bring out the foreground a little, but it doesn''t need much.  Ideally the foreground flowers would be a little more crisp focus with a flower right in front of the bee, but that''s pretty hard to control.  :)  You could crop this shot closer, use some USM to sharpen it really crisp, and add a nice white border, and I think this shot would have scored better.</td>', 'Hi Brandon,  I think your lighting and colours are really good.  With advanced editing, you could certainly do a little dodging/burning to drop the background and bring out the foreground a little, but it doesn''t need much.  Ideally the foreground flowers would be a little more crisp focus with a flower right in front of the bee, but that''s pretty hard to control.  :)  You could crop this shot closer, use some USM to sharpen it really crisp, and add a nice white border, and I think this shot would have scored better.', '2008-04-08 02:03:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622844, 663591, 42013, '<td valign="top">Sweet finish Kris. You are really getting some HQ bird shots.</td>', 'Sweet finish Kris. You are really getting some HQ bird shots.', '2008-04-08 02:03:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622845, 655620, 42013, '<td valign="top">NIcely done Marac. Such perfect DOF and her expression is so.... mesmerizing.</td>', 'NIcely done Marac. Such perfect DOF and her expression is so.... mesmerizing.', '2008-04-08 02:06:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622846, 664245, 67145, '<td valign="top">a brilliant and beautiful photograph steve .. congratulations on an excellent place in the free study .. :)</td>', 'a brilliant and beautiful photograph steve .. congratulations on an excellent place in the free study .. :)', '2008-04-08 02:07:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622847, 664245, 69668, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a top ten finish.  A beautiful image.</td>', 'Congrats on a top ten finish.  A beautiful image.', '2008-04-08 02:07:42.000000', NULL, 0),
