(4622867, 661752, 72103, '<td valign="top">Perfect balance...............</td>', 'Perfect balance...............', '2008-04-08 02:19:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622868, 660597, 30982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous.  I find it hard to shoot these - they''re so vibrant!  You did an excellent job getting that vibrance just right.  I very much like the perspective you chose to show that spiky stem they have, as well as the touch of yellow.  Congratulations on an excellent score and a new entry on your top row.  This is beautiful!</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous.  I find it hard to shoot these - they''re so vibrant!  You did an excellent job getting that vibrance just right.  I very much like the perspective you chose to show that spiky stem they have, as well as the touch of yellow.  Congratulations on an excellent score and a new entry on your top row.  This is beautiful!', '2008-04-08 02:20:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622870, 659996, 39430, '<td valign="top">Critique...<br/>I agree with the comments made.  The bee is the focus of this image, but it doesn''t stand out from the flowers at all.  A different viewpoint may have helped to outline the dark bee against some light flowers instead of blending in to the dark stems.  I would crop off 3/4 of this image, leaving the bee in the top-right thirds point, so it''s looking down into the image.  Then dodge the bee to bring it out a little.</td>', 'Critique...I agree with the comments made.  The bee is the focus of this image, but it doesn''t stand out from the flowers at all.  A different viewpoint may have helped to outline the dark bee against some light flowers instead of blending in to the dark stems.  I would crop off 3/4 of this image, leaving the bee in the top-right thirds point, so it''s looking down into the image.  Then dodge the bee to bring it out a little.', '2008-04-08 02:20:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622871, 661561, 38930, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is amazing!  Have you tried cropping this just above the flowers and taking out the tree on the left?  This is unbelievable!</td>', 'Wow, this is amazing!  Have you tried cropping this just above the flowers and taking out the tree on the left?  This is unbelievable!', '2008-04-08 02:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622872, 658482, 38930, '<td valign="top">This is fun to look at</td>', 'This is fun to look at', '2008-04-08 02:21:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622873, 662424, 30982, '<td valign="top">All sorts of good stuff with this shot!  ''Grats on the ribbon, the PB, the 7... and the shot.  Nice work, Andi!</td>', 'All sorts of good stuff with this shot!  ''Grats on the ribbon, the PB, the 7... and the shot.  Nice work, Andi!', '2008-04-08 02:22:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622875, 661723, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely! You take the most amazing flower pictures - they are always so beautiful. Congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'This is just lovely! You take the most amazing flower pictures - they are always so beautiful. Congrats on your ribbon.', '2008-04-08 02:24:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622876, 660165, 41337, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot Sandy! The technicals are simply flawless.</td>', 'Excellent shot Sandy! The technicals are simply flawless.', '2008-04-08 02:25:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622877, 663797, 75781, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot.  Really.  Very underrated.  The emotion, the colors, the feeling of the photo is so well done.<br/> <br/>I would maybe a tad less on the contrast, but thats just personal preference I think. :)<br/> <br/>anywho, grats on the great shot.</td>', 'Amazing shot.  Really.  Very underrated.  The emotion, the colors, the feeling of the photo is so well done. I would maybe a tad less on the contrast, but thats just personal preference I think. :) anywho, grats on the great shot.', '2008-04-08 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622879, 660013, 33352, '<td valign="top">Talk about climbing ladders great work Roz,The macro is awesome.</td>', 'Talk about climbing ladders great work Roz,The macro is awesome.', '2008-04-08 02:29:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622881, 656276, 39430, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, and a lovely letter to go with it.  :)  I''m sure my 4yo daughter would love a pink portrait of herself.  There are 2 things that I think let the photo down in the scores.  Firstly, the soft focus is great, but needs to be sharpened.  Soft focus is a large area softness, and still needs the pixel-size sharpening on top so that soft focus doesn''t lean toward blurry.  The other thing is the dynamic range.  This is a great high-key portrait, but the highs don''t quite go to white.  Careful tweaking of the levels or curves will improve this image a lot.  And white BW is nice, a little bit of pink never goes astray.  :)</td>', 'Lovely shot, and a lovely letter to go with it.  :)  I''m sure my 4yo daughter would love a pink portrait of herself.  There are 2 things that I think let the photo down in the scores.  Firstly, the soft focus is great, but needs to be sharpened.  Soft focus is a large area softness, and still needs the pixel-size sharpening on top so that soft focus doesn''t lean toward blurry.  The other thing is the dynamic range.  This is a great high-key portrait, but the highs don''t quite go to white.  Careful tweaking of the levels or curves will improve this image a lot.  And white BW is nice, a little bit of pink never goes astray.  :)', '2008-04-08 02:31:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622887, 660165, 60915, '<td valign="top">Yes, he does look like a very nice person and I think you''ve captured that in this shot. Beautiful work, Sandy! : )</td>', 'Yes, he does look like a very nice person and I think you''ve captured that in this shot. Beautiful work, Sandy! : )', '2008-04-08 02:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622888, 664464, 18552, '<td valign="top">I love the colors of your picture - all the golden tones. It is so warm and happy feeling.</td>', 'I love the colors of your picture - all the golden tones. It is so warm and happy feeling.', '2008-04-08 02:36:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622889, 662424, 77192, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon and breaking the magic 7 mark Ecce. This was my favourite of the  challenge :-)</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon and breaking the magic 7 mark Ecce. This was my favourite of the  challenge :-)', '2008-04-08 02:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622890, 661723, 18450, '<td valign="top">Whooooooot!!!! WTG Sally! Congrats on your well deserved blue with this gorgeous image!</td>', 'Whooooooot!!!! WTG Sally! Congrats on your well deserved blue with this gorgeous image!', '2008-04-08 02:38:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622891, 662757, 60915, '<td valign="top">Great action shot and nice finish there, Judi! : )</td>', 'Great action shot and nice finish there, Judi! : )', '2008-04-08 02:38:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622893, 663955, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hi Craig.  Here''s a critique for you...<br/>Colour are nicely saturated, and contrast is quite good, perhaps just a touch dark from the high-contrast back-lighting.  I don''t think the focus is an issue - a little USM on the final shot would fix this up no problem.  Composition-wise, the lighthouse as the focus of the image might be better larger in the frame and off-centred a little.  The log is fighting for attention here, so if you want to use two very different subjects like this, you need to find a way to link them.  Perhaps they can mirror each other''s shapes, or connect together in some way.  Alternatively, pick one of them.  The lighthouse with the keeper''s hut is so nice on it''s own, you can probably get a great shot by forgetting about the log, and walking closer the lighthouse.  Different times of day would give many different great moods and lighting on this lighthouse.  I hope you''ve planned some times to revisit this location.  :)  (by the way, where is it?)</td>', 'Hi Craig.  Here''s a critique for you...Colour are nicely saturated, and contrast is quite good, perhaps just a touch dark from the high-contrast back-lighting.  I don''t think the focus is an issue - a little USM on the final shot would fix this up no problem.  Composition-wise, the lighthouse as the focus of the image might be better larger in the frame and off-centred a little.  The log is fighting for attention here, so if you want to use two very different subjects like this, you need to find a way to link them.  Perhaps they can mirror each other''s shapes, or connect together in some way.  Alternatively, pick one of them.  The lighthouse with the keeper''s hut is so nice on it''s own, you can probably get a great shot by forgetting about the log, and walking closer the lighthouse.  Different times of day would give many different great moods and lighting on this lighthouse.  I hope you''ve planned some times to revisit this location.  :)  (by the way, where is it?)', '2008-04-08 02:40:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622896, 656600, 60915, '<td valign="top">Well this is pretty damn awsome, man! Congrats on twenty oneth! : )</td>', 'Well this is pretty damn awsome, man! Congrats on twenty oneth! : )', '2008-04-08 02:42:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622898, 662424, 42013, '<td valign="top">Guess it will be on your front page for a while! And on DPC''s this week! Congrats.</td>', 'Guess it will be on your front page for a while! And on DPC''s this week! Congrats.', '2008-04-08 02:45:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622903, 664105, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hi Donna, here''s a critique...<br/>This is a great snow image.  The detail in the trees is amazing.  I would be tempted to crop this image closer.  The buildings on the left don''t really add to this composition.  I''m not sure about the right - there''s some really nice branch detail there, so you''d have to trade this off against getting rid of the building.  So I''d try some closer crops to see how much of these can be removed and still keep the feel of the image.  The tree and the benches are the important part, and enough of the detailed branches needs to be kept to show the feeling.  There''s some subtle colours here.  I can see blues, greens, and also some warmer pinks on the left, with an almost peach-blossom feel.  I would work with some colour balance adjustments to see what can come from these subtle colours, and whether they could be enhanced, or desaturated to improve the overall image.</td>', 'Hi Donna, here''s a critique...This is a great snow image.  The detail in the trees is amazing.  I would be tempted to crop this image closer.  The buildings on the left don''t really add to this composition.  I''m not sure about the right - there''s some really nice branch detail there, so you''d have to trade this off against getting rid of the building.  So I''d try some closer crops to see how much of these can be removed and still keep the feel of the image.  The tree and the benches are the important part, and enough of the detailed branches needs to be kept to show the feeling.  There''s some subtle colours here.  I can see blues, greens, and also some warmer pinks on the left, with an almost peach-blossom feel.  I would work with some colour balance adjustments to see what can come from these subtle colours, and whether they could be enhanced, or desaturated to improve the overall image.', '2008-04-08 02:49:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622905, 663912, 22301, '<td valign="top">these colors are amazing, I really like it.</td>', 'these colors are amazing, I really like it.', '2008-04-08 02:51:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622907, 664147, 79955, '<td valign="top">Great shot Irene</td>', 'Great shot Irene', '2008-04-08 02:52:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622908, 662403, 22301, '<td valign="top">looks great Deb, congrats on your 6 score :)</td>', 'looks great Deb, congrats on your 6 score :)', '2008-04-08 02:53:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622909, 658187, 79955, '<td valign="top">I agree with the rest of them. Wonderful shot... Andrew</td>', 'I agree with the rest of them. Wonderful shot... Andrew', '2008-04-08 02:54:13.000000', NULL, 0),
