(4622970, 661742, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hi Pug, here''s a critique for you.<br/>These flowers are appearing in a few photos this month.  Must be the right time of year.  :)  Interesting texture in the shiny paint.  I don''t think it quite looks like ice, but no matter.  The colours are not bad, although a little shadow boost and saturation boost might help.  Being a car, it''s more a grey blue - perhaps a real blue blue might look nicer.  The negatives for me are the crop and the lighting.  The left side of the image isn''t really adding anything.  There''s another reflection of something else there, as well as the flower stem and it''s shadow, all distracting from the subject of the flower and it''s reflection, and the line of the stem leads the eye out of the picture.  I''d remove whatever else was making the other reflection.  The shallow DOF is nice, although some of the petals are a little blurry.  But a nice idea</td>', 'Hi Pug, here''s a critique for you.These flowers are appearing in a few photos this month.  Must be the right time of year.  :)  Interesting texture in the shiny paint.  I don''t think it quite looks like ice, but no matter.  The colours are not bad, although a little shadow boost and saturation boost might help.  Being a car, it''s more a grey blue - perhaps a real blue blue might look nicer.  The negatives for me are the crop and the lighting.  The left side of the image isn''t really adding anything.  There''s another reflection of something else there, as well as the flower stem and it''s shadow, all distracting from the subject of the flower and it''s reflection, and the line of the stem leads the eye out of the picture.  I''d remove whatever else was making the other reflection.  The shallow DOF is nice, although some of the petals are a little blurry.  But a nice idea', '2008-04-08 03:35:22.000000', NULL, 0),
