(4623090, 659811, 66616, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Fetor:</b></div><hr/><i> no east coast beach ive ever been to looks like this! i almost want to call you out and be like "thats cannon beach, you should know geography better" </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There are other continents with east coast Beaches! This one is in Australia,a large Island in the southern Hemisphere, check your atlas you might find it. You should know your geography better......</td>', 'Originally posted by Fetor: no east coast beach ive ever been to looks like this! i almost want to call you out and be like "thats cannon beach, you should know geography better"   There are other continents with east coast Beaches! This one is in Australia,a large Island in the southern Hemisphere, check your atlas you might find it. You should know your geography better......', '2008-04-08 05:24:25.000000', NULL, 0),
