(4623096, 662729, 30982, '<td valign="top">For being destroyed it''s in pretty good shape!  A very clean rendering of the structure and a nice effect (be it light or processing or both) on the bushes in the foreground.  Very crisp and clear detail.  Things to look at - the blur/gradient (?) in the upper left creates a sort of claustrophobic feel to me.  I do like your use of blur in the lower left.  The composition creates a leading line type of scenario but that line leads to the outbuilding and power lines in the lower right.  It is an intriguing structure - would like to see more of it!  (And you have some very interesting work in your portfolio - I love the kitty in the shower!)</td>', 'For being destroyed it''s in pretty good shape!  A very clean rendering of the structure and a nice effect (be it light or processing or both) on the bushes in the foreground.  Very crisp and clear detail.  Things to look at - the blur/gradient (?) in the upper left creates a sort of claustrophobic feel to me.  I do like your use of blur in the lower left.  The composition creates a leading line type of scenario but that line leads to the outbuilding and power lines in the lower right.  It is an intriguing structure - would like to see more of it!  (And you have some very interesting work in your portfolio - I love the kitty in the shower!)', '2008-04-08 05:53:10.000000', NULL, 0),
