(4623261, 663797, 53147, '<td valign="top">Thought so. ;) I didn''t vote in this (I was just looking around throughout the week) but I sure figured this would place higher for all the same reasons you did. Very nice work Enzo.</td>', 'Thought so. ;) I didn''t vote in this (I was just looking around throughout the week) but I sure figured this would place higher for all the same reasons you did. Very nice work Enzo.', '2008-04-08 08:43:44.000000', NULL, 0),
