(4623287, 661723, 30982, '<td valign="top">How positively delightful, from his rather concerned expression and precarious position to the yellow petals that look like they''ve been tipped with lavendar frosting.  Excellent photograph and congratulations on a well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'How positively delightful, from his rather concerned expression and precarious position to the yellow petals that look like they''ve been tipped with lavendar frosting.  Excellent photograph and congratulations on a well deserved ribbon!', '2008-04-08 09:18:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623295, 664282, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''ll concur with several others that not seeing the dogs face, especially the eyes, held this back.  It was the first thing I noticed.  This could have scored probably 6+ if a more emotional connection between the viewer and the dog was made (via seeing the eyes).  JMO of course.  :-)</td>', 'I''ll concur with several others that not seeing the dogs face, especially the eyes, held this back.  It was the first thing I noticed.  This could have scored probably 6+ if a more emotional connection between the viewer and the dog was made (via seeing the eyes).  JMO of course.  :-)', '2008-04-08 09:23:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623297, 660013, 11518, '<td valign="top">Congrats on 4th!  Yer becoming quite the macro queen!</td>', 'Congrats on 4th!  Yer becoming quite the macro queen!', '2008-04-08 09:30:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623299, 662757, 11518, '<td valign="top">Congrats on top 10.</td>', 'Congrats on top 10.', '2008-04-08 09:33:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623305, 664282, 67697, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6.  I thought you did a good job of capturing a raw moment.  I didn''t give it a higher score because I thought the contrast was a little too heavy in front and the eyes and mouth were too dark.  I''d want to be able to at least see more of the snarl.</td>', 'I gave this a 6.  I thought you did a good job of capturing a raw moment.  I didn''t give it a higher score because I thought the contrast was a little too heavy in front and the eyes and mouth were too dark.  I''d want to be able to at least see more of the snarl.', '2008-04-08 09:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623306, 664282, 16531, '<td valign="top">I agree about not seeing the dogs eyes .<br/>As dog lover the first thing I saw when viewing this was that big old chain .<br/>As a photog the hot spot on the dogs shoulder and back  was distracting .<br/>Kudos to you brother for feeding the dog .<br/></td>', 'I agree about not seeing the dogs eyes .As dog lover the first thing I saw when viewing this was that big old chain .As a photog the hot spot on the dogs shoulder and back  was distracting .Kudos to you brother for feeding the dog .', '2008-04-08 09:41:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623332, 657869, 77425, '<td valign="top">I like that your trying something different. The kid is cute, the pose works on a young, free spirit, although I think i would have straightened it so his eyes were level. The harsh light on his face really is, IMO, the biggest negative. The only other complaint that i could come up with in the photo is the halo around the dome.</td>', 'I like that your trying something different. The kid is cute, the pose works on a young, free spirit, although I think i would have straightened it so his eyes were level. The harsh light on his face really is, IMO, the biggest negative. The only other complaint that i could come up with in the photo is the halo around the dome.', '2008-04-08 09:59:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623334, 660013, 15711, '<td valign="top">Crap! 4th place????  Congrats, girl.</td>', 'Crap! 4th place????  Congrats, girl.', '2008-04-08 09:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
