(4623349, 662424, 9821, '<td valign="top">Seems I had no idea what I was talking about. Congratulations! The 7 looks good on you.<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ecce Signum:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hopper:</b></div><hr/><i> actually, i''m thinking you''re going to need a higher score to be in ribbon territory ... 3rd place is going to be 7.2ish ... i''m guessing<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ecce Signum:</b></div><hr/><i> OK, let the voting stop now :)<br/> <br/>Votes: 88  <br/>Views: 154  <br/>Avg Vote: 7.0114  <br/>Comments: 9  <br/>Favorites: 1  <br/>Wish Lists: 0 </i></td></tr></table> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL am sure you are right, its just that I''ve never scored a 7 before (still a way to go) and it will help me greatly in the FSM. Also, a 7 no Ribbon icon looks quite cool </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Seems I had no idea what I was talking about. Congratulations! The 7 looks good on you. :) Originally posted by Ecce Signum: Originally posted by hopper: actually, i''m thinking you''re going to need a higher score to be in ribbon territory ... 3rd place is going to be 7.2ish ... i''m guessing Originally posted by Ecce Signum: OK, let the voting stop now :) Votes: 88  Views: 154  Avg Vote: 7.0114  Comments: 9  Favorites: 1  Wish Lists: 0    LOL am sure you are right, its just that I''ve never scored a 7 before (still a way to go) and it will help me greatly in the FSM. Also, a 7 no Ribbon icon looks quite cool ', '2008-04-08 10:05:38.000000', NULL, 0),
