(4623372, 657869, 34462, '<td valign="top">I agree with the Avg Commenters. This is a really good photo. I love his expression and body gestures, like he is getting ready to move into his presto-karate move.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I agree with the Avg Commenters. This is a really good photo. I love his expression and body gestures, like he is getting ready to move into his presto-karate move. ', '2008-04-08 10:14:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623377, 661718, 60047, '<td valign="top">What a great moment captured - the work of a true professional.</td>', 'What a great moment captured - the work of a true professional.', '2008-04-08 10:15:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623380, 655373, 77425, '<td valign="top">Gradient background is a great setup, but like others have said, looks blown out at the base. I think the curved glasses could have been better set up symetricaly with the gradient. (they aren''t centered) Looks like some air bubbles sticking to the side of the glass filled with water? a little distracting. The dead rose is to dark, and neither of their leaves have much color in them. Thats my opinion.</td>', 'Gradient background is a great setup, but like others have said, looks blown out at the base. I think the curved glasses could have been better set up symetricaly with the gradient. (they aren''t centered) Looks like some air bubbles sticking to the side of the glass filled with water? a little distracting. The dead rose is to dark, and neither of their leaves have much color in them. Thats my opinion.', '2008-04-08 10:16:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623382, 663219, 34462, '<td valign="top">Nice capture Jon. It does look as if he has just bumped over that chimney.</td>', 'Nice capture Jon. It does look as if he has just bumped over that chimney.', '2008-04-08 10:16:46.000000', NULL, 0);
