(4623392, 662878, 34462, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful old instrument and you have captured it well both here and in the Curves challenge. Do you still play?  I mean on one with more strings....</td>', 'This is a beautiful old instrument and you have captured it well both here and in the Curves challenge. Do you still play?  I mean on one with more strings....', '2008-04-08 10:19:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623396, 659097, 77425, '<td valign="top">Overall the image has a lot of noise. I''m personally not a fan of the nose being in focus when this cat has such big yellow eyes. Maybe shouldn''t have cropped the top of his/her ear and bottom of face off either.</td>', 'Overall the image has a lot of noise. I''m personally not a fan of the nose being in focus when this cat has such big yellow eyes. Maybe shouldn''t have cropped the top of his/her ear and bottom of face off either.', '2008-04-08 10:20:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623410, 660013, 87252, '<td valign="top">Great stuff roz, well deserved. I love the greens in this, beautiful.</td>', 'Great stuff roz, well deserved. I love the greens in this, beautiful.', '2008-04-08 10:24:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623414, 663112, 77425, '<td valign="top">I do like the shallow DOF, putting the focus where it should be. The angle works, but I''m not a fan of the crop. I would like to see the entire square that belongs to the subject, and the corner on right side of the photo, IMO, needs to be gone.</td>', 'I do like the shallow DOF, putting the focus where it should be. The angle works, but I''m not a fan of the crop. I would like to see the entire square that belongs to the subject, and the corner on right side of the photo, IMO, needs to be gone.', '2008-04-08 10:27:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623418, 660165, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s so good Sandy.  Considering how many entries there were, this is an unbelievable finish! CONGRATS</td>', 'That''s so good Sandy.  Considering how many entries there were, this is an unbelievable finish! CONGRATS', '2008-04-08 10:29:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623420, 664215, 32997, '<td valign="top">brilliant feel for composition...</td>', 'brilliant feel for composition...', '2008-04-08 10:30:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623422, 662360, 77425, '<td valign="top">The inside border doesn''t really go over well here on DPC. having it clip the flower on the top doesn''t help either. The way the background flower falls directly behind the one in the foreground, with the same lighting on them, the almost blend together, really taking away from what is a beautiful single flower.</td>', 'The inside border doesn''t really go over well here on DPC. having it clip the flower on the top doesn''t help either. The way the background flower falls directly behind the one in the foreground, with the same lighting on them, the almost blend together, really taking away from what is a beautiful single flower.', '2008-04-08 10:31:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623426, 664147, 73235, '<td valign="top">Irene, beautiful picture. I could have sworn it would score much higher.</td>', 'Irene, beautiful picture. I could have sworn it would score much higher.', '2008-04-08 10:32:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623433, 663685, 73235, '<td valign="top">Alex, I should have known it''s you. You''re ss good at character portraits. Congrats to an other good one.</td>', 'Alex, I should have known it''s you. You''re ss good at character portraits. Congrats to an other good one.', '2008-04-08 10:34:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623434, 661723, 67174, '<td valign="top">Congrats! that frog looks pissed. he''s saying "whats this crazy lady doing taking my picture when I just want to hang out on this flower" and your like "because dude, your cool, and I''ll get a blue for it!" and he''s like "bah.. whatever crazy lady with the camera"  haha</td>', 'Congrats! that frog looks pissed. he''s saying "whats this crazy lady doing taking my picture when I just want to hang out on this flower" and your like "because dude, your cool, and I''ll get a blue for it!" and he''s like "bah.. whatever crazy lady with the camera"  haha', '2008-04-08 10:35:08.000000', NULL, 0),
