(4623611, 664147, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, IRENE!  This is so beautiful!   The exquisite -- perfect -- light.   The textures.  The color.  The framing.   Sheeeeeeesh!   Talk about TALENTED!   <br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, IRENE!  This is so beautiful!   The exquisite -- perfect -- light.   The textures.  The color.  The framing.   Sheeeeeeesh!   Talk about TALENTED!    ', '2008-04-08 11:01:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623612, 663272, 74534, '<td valign="top">Well, one of my favs in this challenge, so low placed at 5.55 and no comments on top of that! Unbelievable. Here''s a comment though: excellent image, great colors that somehow make me think of old iron and rust, which works so well with the bridge in the distance. Very good contrast water/sky/clouds and excellent detail in the sky. My guess it was voted down due to the unconventional harsh look, and the noise in the sky (which I personally like a lot, but what can you do...)</td>', 'Well, one of my favs in this challenge, so low placed at 5.55 and no comments on top of that! Unbelievable. Here''s a comment though: excellent image, great colors that somehow make me think of old iron and rust, which works so well with the bridge in the distance. Very good contrast water/sky/clouds and excellent detail in the sky. My guess it was voted down due to the unconventional harsh look, and the noise in the sky (which I personally like a lot, but what can you do...)', '2008-04-08 11:01:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4623613, 663697, 87808, '<td valign="top">WOW I am totally shocked.  I only commented on 3 entries in this challenge and was surprised that this was not a LOT higher up in the scale.  You did an amazing job and I love this shot.</td>', 'WOW I am totally shocked.  I only commented on 3 entries in this challenge and was surprised that this was not a LOT higher up in the scale.  You did an amazing job and I love this shot.', '2008-04-08 11:03:07.000000', NULL, 0),
