(4623745, 658359, 24454, '<td valign="top">Jennifer, I saw this on OnExposure too and it took my breath away the minute I saw it.  Congratulations most of all on capturing such a mesmerizing photo -- It has a great score and finish -- but I don''t think as great as it truly deserves.   I have enjoyed being exposed to your work so much!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-08 11:05:35.</i></td>', 'Jennifer, I saw this on OnExposure too and it took my breath away the minute I saw it.  Congratulations most of all on capturing such a mesmerizing photo -- It has a great score and finish -- but I don''t think as great as it truly deserves.   I have enjoyed being exposed to your work so much!', '2008-04-08 12:05:02.000000', '2008-04-08 12:05:35.000000', 0),
