(4624097, 656276, 77192, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. From your wonderful letter Kristiana seems to be a bundle of energy, always getting into mischief (am I close?) Which makes this lovely serene calm shot a nice contrast.<br/> <br/>The details on the skin are soft, and the lighting on her face is perfect. I like the high key effect, it works very well for me :-)</td>', 'I like this very much. From your wonderful letter Kristiana seems to be a bundle of energy, always getting into mischief (am I close?) Which makes this lovely serene calm shot a nice contrast. The details on the skin are soft, and the lighting on her face is perfect. I like the high key effect, it works very well for me :-)', '2008-04-08 15:14:32.000000', NULL, 0),
