(4624105, 662719, 55005, '<td valign="top">Damian, congrats on the top 15 finish!</td>', 'Damian, congrats on the top 15 finish!', '2008-04-08 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624111, 663955, 77192, '<td valign="top">I tend to agree with surfdabbler that you need to choose one subject or the other in this shot and for me it''s the lighthouse. Perhaps if you''d stood the other side of the log?<br/> <br/>The blue of the sky is magnificent and although the lighthouse isn''t particularly sharp, I agree with surfdabbler that it''s nothing a little sharpening won''t solve. I like the composition of the lighthouse as well - centred compositions aren''t trendy at DPC (apart from in this week''s challenge lol) but I quite like them.</td>', 'I tend to agree with surfdabbler that you need to choose one subject or the other in this shot and for me it''s the lighthouse. Perhaps if you''d stood the other side of the log? The blue of the sky is magnificent and although the lighthouse isn''t particularly sharp, I agree with surfdabbler that it''s nothing a little sharpening won''t solve. I like the composition of the lighthouse as well - centred compositions aren''t trendy at DPC (apart from in this week''s challenge lol) but I quite like them.', '2008-04-08 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624112, 661723, 65319, '<td valign="top">Sally, Congrats on your BLUE!!!!  Well deserved! I''m thrilled for you!</td>', 'Sally, Congrats on your BLUE!!!!  Well deserved! I''m thrilled for you!', '2008-04-08 15:23:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624116, 655331, 30982, '<td valign="top">That is one very intense look you''re getting!  This is a very good shot, Lea.  Very crisp, great light and color.  Well processed too.  Nicely done!</td>', 'That is one very intense look you''re getting!  This is a very good shot, Lea.  Very crisp, great light and color.  Well processed too.  Nicely done!', '2008-04-08 15:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624125, 661742, 52549, '<td valign="top">I definitely agree with Deb <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> on this one. A tighter crop would have been better, also focusing more on the flower/reflection. I like your idea of using the car for the reflection, I''ll need to try that one of these days ;-)<br/>I slightly desaturated my 4th place shot (the petal) and then toned it a sepia colour while still having some of the original pinky colour. It''s interesting and easy to do and makes quite a difference (just in case you want to try it).<br/>All in all, you have a very nice image here, David. Sensitively photographed.</td>', 'I definitely agree with Deb  Melethia on this one. A tighter crop would have been better, also focusing more on the flower/reflection. I like your idea of using the car for the reflection, I''ll need to try that one of these days ;-)I slightly desaturated my 4th place shot (the petal) and then toned it a sepia colour while still having some of the original pinky colour. It''s interesting and easy to do and makes quite a difference (just in case you want to try it).All in all, you have a very nice image here, David. Sensitively photographed.', '2008-04-08 15:31:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624134, 663736, 66384, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling that people liked the model and the basics of the portrait, but probably didn''t realize the shot was lit by fire. So they probably thought the white balance was off. I''m guessing that would be the reason for the disappointing score.</td>', 'I have a feeling that people liked the model and the basics of the portrait, but probably didn''t realize the shot was lit by fire. So they probably thought the white balance was off. I''m guessing that would be the reason for the disappointing score.', '2008-04-08 15:36:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624136, 660130, 54778, '<td valign="top">There is something very powerful about the image..</td>', 'There is something very powerful about the image..', '2008-04-08 15:37:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624149, 659996, 811, '<td valign="top">I think you have good technical -- the focus is good, the lighting isn''t too harsh, the exposure and white balance are good.  I do think the composition hurts it the most.  <br/> <br/>The bee is almost swallowed up by the flowers and as a result, the technical prowess you exhibited there gets swallowed up as well.  <br/> <br/>It is *almost* centered which can lead to a "static" feeling to begin with, but it is just a bit off, so it also has a slight unbalanced feeling as well.  I think either making the bee completely centered, or leading the composition left or right would at least eliminate one of the distractions.<br/> <br/>For me, personally, the shot doesn''t say a lot more than "I can take a bee picture in focus"  (which is a good thing) or perhaps a bit more emotionally, "Spring is here!"  Unfortunately, outside of nature (photography) enthusiasts, there may not be a lot in this shot to grab the viewer and compell them to be moved inside.  <br/> <br/>If your purpose is to create technically well done and pleasing shots, you have done well.  If you want a bit more emotion in your shots, this may fall a touch short.</td>', 'I think you have good technical -- the focus is good, the lighting isn''t too harsh, the exposure and white balance are good.  I do think the composition hurts it the most.   The bee is almost swallowed up by the flowers and as a result, the technical prowess you exhibited there gets swallowed up as well.   It is *almost* centered which can lead to a "static" feeling to begin with, but it is just a bit off, so it also has a slight unbalanced feeling as well.  I think either making the bee completely centered, or leading the composition left or right would at least eliminate one of the distractions. For me, personally, the shot doesn''t say a lot more than "I can take a bee picture in focus"  (which is a good thing) or perhaps a bit more emotionally, "Spring is here!"  Unfortunately, outside of nature (photography) enthusiasts, there may not be a lot in this shot to grab the viewer and compell them to be moved inside.   If your purpose is to create technically well done and pleasing shots, you have done well.  If you want a bit more emotion in your shots, this may fall a touch short.', '2008-04-08 15:45:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624150, 663642, 66384, '<td valign="top">The hares are wonderful, and nicely isolated from their surrounding. I think I would like the image better if some of the foreground blur was cropped away. But that is just my personal reaction to most foreground blur. Congratulations on a really high placement in the very large field of entries.</td>', 'The hares are wonderful, and nicely isolated from their surrounding. I think I would like the image better if some of the foreground blur was cropped away. But that is just my personal reaction to most foreground blur. Congratulations on a really high placement in the very large field of entries.', '2008-04-08 15:46:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624160, 661620, 66384, '<td valign="top">The perspective here makes the palapa look like a huge hairy mushroom. The water and sunset are beautiful. I particularly like the slight reflection of the sunset in the water. The colors look very natural. I can see this as a large travel poster, with the ad text in the top third of the image.</td>', 'The perspective here makes the palapa look like a huge hairy mushroom. The water and sunset are beautiful. I particularly like the slight reflection of the sunset in the water. The colors look very natural. I can see this as a large travel poster, with the ad text in the top third of the image.', '2008-04-08 15:51:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624163, 660864, 66515, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even know about this place. Another locale in Alberta for me to visit. Thanks for sharing this with us!</td>', 'I didn''t even know about this place. Another locale in Alberta for me to visit. Thanks for sharing this with us!', '2008-04-08 15:53:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624164, 663635, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the processing -- you took a hard cold scene and made it soft and warm. I especially like the luminosity in the sky. And I like the fading around the edges.</td>', 'Love the processing -- you took a hard cold scene and made it soft and warm. I especially like the luminosity in the sky. And I like the fading around the edges.', '2008-04-08 15:56:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624170, 662570, 66384, '<td valign="top">Oooo, beautiful. You have really learned how to make your colors POP. I first noticed that on your wonderful rooster last summer. I have got to take some lessons from you.</td>', 'Oooo, beautiful. You have really learned how to make your colors POP. I first noticed that on your wonderful rooster last summer. I have got to take some lessons from you.', '2008-04-08 16:00:45.000000', NULL, 0),
