(4624506, 664297, 68035, '<td valign="top">Gee Ron that bridge has been good for you, two shots within your top 4 within a week, cant be bad, congratulations<br/> <br/>Its funny to compare and contrast the two and I guess the HDR version does have a great depth and strength of colour to it, but the interesting thing (to me anyway) is the fact that the red light of the single car going up the hill and by the shoreline seem almost more vibrant<br/> <br/>Great picture Ron</td>', 'Gee Ron that bridge has been good for you, two shots within your top 4 within a week, cant be bad, congratulations Its funny to compare and contrast the two and I guess the HDR version does have a great depth and strength of colour to it, but the interesting thing (to me anyway) is the fact that the red light of the single car going up the hill and by the shoreline seem almost more vibrant Great picture Ron', '2008-04-08 19:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624517, 663685, 37961, '<td valign="top">He was probably really handsome in his hay day. Ain''t too bad now! Needs a cleaner shorter haircut though.</td>', 'He was probably really handsome in his hay day. Ain''t too bad now! Needs a cleaner shorter haircut though.', '2008-04-08 19:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624524, 661744, 37961, '<td valign="top">d d d delightful.</td>', 'd d d delightful.', '2008-04-08 19:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624559, 662403, 69557, '<td valign="top">melethia,<br/> <br/>glorious indeed!<br/> <br/>p.s. thanks for the posthumous award on my first photo. you rock :D.</td>', 'melethia, glorious indeed! p.s. thanks for the posthumous award on my first photo. you rock :D.', '2008-04-08 19:31:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624610, 660013, 51269, '<td valign="top">OHHHH, Rozzie- what a magnificent macro and well deserved high placement (look at those numbers)- I am sooo proud of you. XO, Pat</td>', 'OHHHH, Rozzie- what a magnificent macro and well deserved high placement (look at those numbers)- I am sooo proud of you. XO, Pat', '2008-04-08 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624613, 664245, 51269, '<td valign="top">Well, Steve, ain''t you THE ONE !!!! Excellent placement &amp; so well deserved- actually should have ribboned :)-your fan,P</td>', 'Well, Steve, ain''t you THE ONE !!!! Excellent placement & so well deserved- actually should have ribboned :)-your fan,P', '2008-04-08 20:04:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624620, 662424, 59029, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot Andi, I had the chance to see a snowy owlet(?) up close this summer, the cutest ball of grey fluff...but it certainly had those huge feet/talons, piercing eyes and bill!  I imagine it looks a lot like your magnificent owl by now!</td>', 'Lovely shot Andi, I had the chance to see a snowy owlet(?) up close this summer, the cutest ball of grey fluff...but it certainly had those huge feet/talons, piercing eyes and bill!  I imagine it looks a lot like your magnificent owl by now!', '2008-04-08 20:11:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624633, 662729, 91295, '<td valign="top">I basically like the composition, but think that two things could make this image better.  First, more aggressive cropping, especially the right side/bottom right corner of the photo.  the modern building and telephone wires on the right are distracting (IMO) from the rest of the image.  The second things is that building does not stand out....maybe it needs stronger lighting or Photoshop work?</td>', 'I basically like the composition, but think that two things could make this image better.  First, more aggressive cropping, especially the right side/bottom right corner of the photo.  the modern building and telephone wires on the right are distracting (IMO) from the rest of the image.  The second things is that building does not stand out....maybe it needs stronger lighting or Photoshop work?', '2008-04-08 20:24:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624649, 661116, 91295, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot (gave it a 6), but I have to agree with the other comments on the darkness of the truck.  I would have liked to see just a little bit more truck detail.  The flashlight idea sounds great....though I am pretty new trying to get serious about photography, so what do I know 8-).  I loved the sky. the tree. and the composition in general.</td>', 'I liked this shot (gave it a 6), but I have to agree with the other comments on the darkness of the truck.  I would have liked to see just a little bit more truck detail.  The flashlight idea sounds great....though I am pretty new trying to get serious about photography, so what do I know 8-).  I loved the sky. the tree. and the composition in general.', '2008-04-08 20:31:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624670, 661742, 91295, '<td valign="top">For me, the reflections of the branches are distracting and take away from the rest of the image.  Perhaps cutting the stem much closer to the flower....although from the reflections it looks like the branch might have been pulled down for the picture...not actually cut.  I also don''t want to sound like a broken record, but I think a tighter crop would help.</td>', 'For me, the reflections of the branches are distracting and take away from the rest of the image.  Perhaps cutting the stem much closer to the flower....although from the reflections it looks like the branch might have been pulled down for the picture...not actually cut.  I also don''t want to sound like a broken record, but I think a tighter crop would help.', '2008-04-08 20:39:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624687, 657869, 91295, '<td valign="top">For me, I loved everything about this shot except the "vogue" part.  However, this is such a personal shot that what I think does not really matter.  I still gave it a good score because I loved the contrast, the tilt, the lighting on his face.  I don''t think I would have changed much on this one.</td>', 'For me, I loved everything about this shot except the "vogue" part.  However, this is such a personal shot that what I think does not really matter.  I still gave it a good score because I loved the contrast, the tilt, the lighting on his face.  I don''t think I would have changed much on this one.', '2008-04-08 20:48:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624704, 660126, 65083, '<td valign="top">I will agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=75958" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bradshaw</a> that b/w are better simple.  But what do I know you scored higher then I did :)</td>', 'I will agree with  bradshaw that b/w are better simple.  But what do I know you scored higher then I did :)', '2008-04-08 20:57:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624706, 662415, 66267, '<td valign="top">Gross...</td>', 'Gross...', '2008-04-08 21:02:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624709, 657035, 65083, '<td valign="top">Hey I see nothing wrong with this I like it.  I have no clue on how you did it so to me it looks cool.</td>', 'Hey I see nothing wrong with this I like it.  I have no clue on how you did it so to me it looks cool.', '2008-04-08 21:03:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624711, 662627, 65083, '<td valign="top">Ian, another one that I like alot.  Maybe a tigher crop but for the most part I think it is good.</td>', 'Ian, another one that I like alot.  Maybe a tigher crop but for the most part I think it is good.', '2008-04-08 21:05:32.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4624713, 662360, 65083, '<td valign="top">Erica, I think you got screwed with scoring as this is a great photo.</td>', 'Erica, I think you got screwed with scoring as this is a great photo.', '2008-04-08 21:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624719, 655373, 65083, '<td valign="top">Hey great idea, like the others maybe a tigher crop.  But then you do great work so you should be proud.</td>', 'Hey great idea, like the others maybe a tigher crop.  But then you do great work so you should be proud.', '2008-04-08 21:10:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624723, 663112, 65083, '<td valign="top">Chris, I like this image and I know nothing about how you pp it only to say that I like the look of it.</td>', 'Chris, I like this image and I know nothing about how you pp it only to say that I like the look of it.', '2008-04-08 21:13:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624724, 662403, 91295, '<td valign="top">I loved this image (I wish I could take something this stunning).  I apologize for hot having anything constructive to add.....</td>', 'I loved this image (I wish I could take something this stunning).  I apologize for hot having anything constructive to add.....', '2008-04-08 21:13:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624741, 662570, 60862, '<td valign="top">Yay, Catherine! :)  Knew this was a winner when I first saw it!</td>', 'Yay, Catherine! :)  Knew this was a winner when I first saw it!', '2008-04-08 21:20:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624754, 664138, 91295, '<td valign="top">I think this really needs to be cropped to remove the blown out upper right corner.  At that point, I then looked at cropping the bottom to remove the knee.  Yes, you loose the sword, but to me that is the only significant detail.  I find that crop much more pleasing.</td>', 'I think this really needs to be cropped to remove the blown out upper right corner.  At that point, I then looked at cropping the bottom to remove the knee.  Yes, you loose the sword, but to me that is the only significant detail.  I find that crop much more pleasing.', '2008-04-08 21:22:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624789, 656627, 92320, '<td valign="top">Fantastic Job!</td>', 'Fantastic Job!', '2008-04-08 21:33:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624843, 656600, 24454, '<td valign="top">Whoa!!!  I''m glad it did well too.  I think I would have had to quit in resignation that this site is totally clueless if this one had not done well.   Oh how I love your style.  Your unique look to every landscape photo.    One could learn so much from your photos.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Whoa!!!  I''m glad it did well too.  I think I would have had to quit in resignation that this site is totally clueless if this one had not done well.   Oh how I love your style.  Your unique look to every landscape photo.    One could learn so much from your photos. ', '2008-04-08 22:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624854, 661723, 90495, '<td valign="top">Like I said during voting, 10! <br/> <br/>Congratulations.<br/> <br/>Now I need to ask, did you place the frog there or did you come upon it in nature?</td>', 'Like I said during voting, 10!  Congratulations. Now I need to ask, did you place the frog there or did you come upon it in nature?', '2008-04-08 22:27:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624860, 656627, 90495, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see this during voting, pity, you would have scored a wee bit higher due to my vote of ten.<br/> <br/>Congrats.</td>', 'I didn''t see this during voting, pity, you would have scored a wee bit higher due to my vote of ten. Congrats.', '2008-04-08 22:30:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624886, 664301, 7778, '<td valign="top">A great expanse, apparently pristine, and quite a successful landscape with a strong point of interest in the fore-, both visually and emotionally. The cooler tones caress the fish, and the tide has left a hem of maritime debris from here to there. (I gave it a 6, but never got around to comment),</td>', 'A great expanse, apparently pristine, and quite a successful landscape with a strong point of interest in the fore-, both visually and emotionally. The cooler tones caress the fish, and the tide has left a hem of maritime debris from here to there. (I gave it a 6, but never got around to comment),', '2008-04-08 22:44:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4624988, 663219, 58728, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s about to bellyflop!  Love this shot.  Hysterical title.</td>', 'Looks like he''s about to bellyflop!  Love this shot.  Hysterical title.', '2008-04-08 23:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625026, 659674, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow, how did this score under 6? a real indictment of dpc.</td>', 'wow, how did this score under 6? a real indictment of dpc.', '2008-04-08 23:34:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625031, 660471, 50695, '<td valign="top">awesome! I gave this a 9! and I underrated it. It looks just like the photos in that book "Please Kill Me"</td>', 'awesome! I gave this a 9! and I underrated it. It looks just like the photos in that book "Please Kill Me"', '2008-04-08 23:36:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625035, 664120, 50695, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. I only gave this a 9. What was I thinking???</td>', 'Brilliant. I only gave this a 9. What was I thinking???', '2008-04-08 23:37:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625040, 664325, 50695, '<td valign="top">under 6?? wha???</td>', 'under 6?? wha???', '2008-04-08 23:40:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625043, 662757, 12243, '<td valign="top">ouch is right, congrats!</td>', 'ouch is right, congrats!', '2008-04-08 23:40:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625044, 663177, 50695, '<td valign="top">there is hope for you after all</td>', 'there is hope for you after all', '2008-04-08 23:40:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625045, 663177, 50695, '<td valign="top">p.s. we''re neighbors!!</td>', 'p.s. we''re neighbors!!', '2008-04-08 23:41:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625395, 662708, 43432, '<td valign="top">greate shot!</td>', 'greate shot!', '2008-04-09 01:24:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625665, 658359, 69668, '<td valign="top">Thanks guys for all the great comments.  I appreicate all the kind words.</td>', 'Thanks guys for all the great comments.  I appreicate all the kind words.', '2008-04-09 03:18:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625669, 659629, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna guess that from the title, the soft focus is quite intentional.  :-)  I also think it works very well - wonderful depth and detail, and really gorgeous purple!</td>', 'I''m gonna guess that from the title, the soft focus is quite intentional.  :-)  I also think it works very well - wonderful depth and detail, and really gorgeous purple!', '2008-04-09 03:21:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625749, 659229, 89940, '<td valign="top">I like the exposure on the bee and the background for the bee. The problem is that the only things in focus are the bee''s hind leg, one antenna, and the flower in the lower right corner. A little greater DOF would have been of great benefit here to bring the bee in focus and some of the flowers higher up in the bee''s path. I would have thought that f/9 would have been a sufficient DOF but the bee was apparently just at the edge of the focus range.<br/> <br/>Overall I still like the photo even when the softness of the bee. It really tells a story.</td>', 'I like the exposure on the bee and the background for the bee. The problem is that the only things in focus are the bee''s hind leg, one antenna, and the flower in the lower right corner. A little greater DOF would have been of great benefit here to bring the bee in focus and some of the flowers higher up in the bee''s path. I would have thought that f/9 would have been a sufficient DOF but the bee was apparently just at the edge of the focus range. Overall I still like the photo even when the softness of the bee. It really tells a story.', '2008-04-09 04:03:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625755, 656276, 89940, '<td valign="top">Very cute girl. I really like the pose and the way her eyes are shifted down and out of the photo. I also like thsat the photo is a little soft, it works well for this type of photo. What doesn''t work for me is the high-key look that hides her hair and the fact that the side of her head is cropped off. <br/></td>', 'Very cute girl. I really like the pose and the way her eyes are shifted down and out of the photo. I also like thsat the photo is a little soft, it works well for this type of photo. What doesn''t work for me is the high-key look that hides her hair and the fact that the side of her head is cropped off. ', '2008-04-09 04:08:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625761, 664009, 89940, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo and I gave it a 9 in voting. I like the sharpness and I do like the bright greens unlike <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/811.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/811.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/811.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=811" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">karmat</a>.<br/> <br/>The brown water does stand out quite a bit compared to the rest of the photo but when my eye is drawn there by the color I like that I can see the details under the water. There is more to explore there and I find that interesting.</td>', 'I really like this photo and I gave it a 9 in voting. I like the sharpness and I do like the bright greens unlike  karmat. The brown water does stand out quite a bit compared to the rest of the photo but when my eye is drawn there by the color I like that I can see the details under the water. There is more to explore there and I find that interesting.', '2008-04-09 04:14:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625768, 659996, 89940, '<td valign="top">I really like the sharpness and color in this photo. However the bee blends into the stem of the plant too much and is not very obvious. In fact I don''t recall seeing the bee at all during my voting and that may explain some the scoring. After spending time looking at the photo I now can''t understand how I could have ever not seen the bee, but the fact is I didn''t see it when I first opened up this photo and it took maybe 5-6 seconds before I did see it. Great focus on the bee btw.</td>', 'I really like the sharpness and color in this photo. However the bee blends into the stem of the plant too much and is not very obvious. In fact I don''t recall seeing the bee at all during my voting and that may explain some the scoring. After spending time looking at the photo I now can''t understand how I could have ever not seen the bee, but the fact is I didn''t see it when I first opened up this photo and it took maybe 5-6 seconds before I did see it. Great focus on the bee btw.', '2008-04-09 04:20:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626187, 661723, 79141, '<td valign="top">WOW amazing <br/>congrats on your ribbon so well deserved</td>', 'WOW amazing congrats on your ribbon so well deserved', '2008-04-09 08:41:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626221, 661723, 66348, '<td valign="top">Wow this is beautiful. Congrats on the Ribb.</td>', 'Wow this is beautiful. Congrats on the Ribb.', '2008-04-09 08:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626233, 662624, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great stopped motion, a bit noisy in the shot, but a great capture you should be proud of. well done.</td>', 'Great stopped motion, a bit noisy in the shot, but a great capture you should be proud of. well done.', '2008-04-09 09:02:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626279, 664308, 2240, '<td valign="top">You have done a wonderful job on this photo, I love the colors Shez. I see a big difference in you work (since your operation) Keep up the good work.</td>', 'You have done a wonderful job on this photo, I love the colors Shez. I see a big difference in you work (since your operation) Keep up the good work.', '2008-04-09 09:24:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626350, 662554, 29156, '<td valign="top">nice smoothness and great composition</td>', 'nice smoothness and great composition', '2008-04-09 09:46:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626388, 661008, 67697, '<td valign="top">Dylan - this is a beautiful and emotive capture.  I love the processing.  Great composition.</td>', 'Dylan - this is a beautiful and emotive capture.  I love the processing.  Great composition.', '2008-04-09 09:57:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626414, 663867, 63398, '<td valign="top">Spectacular processing, Rob! This is really nice.</td>', 'Spectacular processing, Rob! This is really nice.', '2008-04-09 10:03:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626428, 662729, 67697, '<td valign="top">I probably won''t be giving you too much more insight beyond what was already said here.  I gave this a 6 during the challenge.  I loved how the bushes and the building had close to a very faint painterly effect.  And the sky is beautiful!  I think I would have scored it higher if the building had more pop or contrast to make it jump out of the picture.</td>', 'I probably won''t be giving you too much more insight beyond what was already said here.  I gave this a 6 during the challenge.  I loved how the bushes and the building had close to a very faint painterly effect.  And the sky is beautiful!  I think I would have scored it higher if the building had more pop or contrast to make it jump out of the picture.', '2008-04-09 10:09:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626441, 660324, 67697, '<td valign="top">Not bad for your first FS entry.  I really got pounded in my first or second one (or maybe both lol).  I will say that I gave this one a 5.  I have higher expectations when I vote in this challenge.  I think you have a very pretty scene but at first glance, nothing grabs my attention.  The tree should be the focal point and it''s competing mostly with that brick on the right.  I personally think this photo is a good candidate for black and white processing.  It will really make the tree pop.  And also cut out the bricks on the right.  Just a thought for you.  :)</td>', 'Not bad for your first FS entry.  I really got pounded in my first or second one (or maybe both lol).  I will say that I gave this one a 5.  I have higher expectations when I vote in this challenge.  I think you have a very pretty scene but at first glance, nothing grabs my attention.  The tree should be the focal point and it''s competing mostly with that brick on the right.  I personally think this photo is a good candidate for black and white processing.  It will really make the tree pop.  And also cut out the bricks on the right.  Just a thought for you.  :)', '2008-04-09 10:13:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626474, 661742, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well I thought this was beautiful and i gave this a 7 on the first pass and unfortunately did not have time for a second re-evaluation.  I''m thinking there are two reasons why I did not give it a higher go around the first time.  1)  The background noise.  Not sure why it''s there at ISO 200 but maybe because of saturation? and 2) I wanted to see more of the flower in focus because to me, that is the main subject.  Not sure how you fix that at f22?  Step back a little further?  Anyway, I still like it lol.</td>', 'Well I thought this was beautiful and i gave this a 7 on the first pass and unfortunately did not have time for a second re-evaluation.  I''m thinking there are two reasons why I did not give it a higher go around the first time.  1)  The background noise.  Not sure why it''s there at ISO 200 but maybe because of saturation? and 2) I wanted to see more of the flower in focus because to me, that is the main subject.  Not sure how you fix that at f22?  Step back a little further?  Anyway, I still like it lol.', '2008-04-09 10:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626706, 658359, 14386, '<td valign="top">definitely a winner in my book.:)</td>', 'definitely a winner in my book.:)', '2008-04-09 11:33:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626902, 664367, 42379, '<td valign="top">I am a little disappointed in the results.  The score is pretty good for my first challenge, but it is in the bottom 30% of the total.  355 out of 499.  Oh well...</td>', 'I am a little disappointed in the results.  The score is pretty good for my first challenge, but it is in the bottom 30% of the total.  355 out of 499.  Oh well...', '2008-04-09 12:24:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626997, 660997, 70896, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I missed this one! I didnt get a chance to look through all the photos. This is wonderful, I love the dream like feel you give your work! <br/> <br/>P.S. Thanks for your comments on my pics! Really appreciate it! :)</td>', 'I can''t believe I missed this one! I didnt get a chance to look through all the photos. This is wonderful, I love the dream like feel you give your work!  P.S. Thanks for your comments on my pics! Really appreciate it! :)', '2008-04-09 12:48:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627031, 662624, 66398, '<td valign="top">Hey thanks for the comments everyone. As for the noise... It was at 1600 iso so I could get the shutter speed at a 60th for a good panning shot. The lighting in there wasn''t good and white balance wasn''t very easy either. I only had 1 coin for him to have 1 ride and took a shot almost every time he came around. This was the ONLY one that turned out. It was really only edited in basic even though I could''ve used advanced. But with the noise already present I didn''t want to do too much for fear of too much destruction of the pixels.</td>', 'Hey thanks for the comments everyone. As for the noise... It was at 1600 iso so I could get the shutter speed at a 60th for a good panning shot. The lighting in there wasn''t good and white balance wasn''t very easy either. I only had 1 coin for him to have 1 ride and took a shot almost every time he came around. This was the ONLY one that turned out. It was really only edited in basic even though I could''ve used advanced. But with the noise already present I didn''t want to do too much for fear of too much destruction of the pixels.', '2008-04-09 12:55:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627033, 661742, 70896, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot, but I think there''s too much of the car in it. I would have liked to see a tighter crop on the flower. The fact that the branch comes in from the top is a little weird. The reflection of the flower is nice.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot, but I think there''s too much of the car in it. I would have liked to see a tighter crop on the flower. The fact that the branch comes in from the top is a little weird. The reflection of the flower is nice.', '2008-04-09 12:55:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627086, 664009, 70896, '<td valign="top">This was a 6 for me. I really like the water and the green. The reflection on the water is great too. I think the log is very distracting to me, as well as the very bottom of the photo.  My biggest problem is that there''s nothing to really capture my attention, nothing that really stands out. It''s just a pretty picture of a waterfall.</td>', 'This was a 6 for me. I really like the water and the green. The reflection on the water is great too. I think the log is very distracting to me, as well as the very bottom of the photo.  My biggest problem is that there''s nothing to really capture my attention, nothing that really stands out. It''s just a pretty picture of a waterfall.', '2008-04-09 13:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627112, 662403, 70896, '<td valign="top">I think this is beautiful, but the only thing I would have done is crop out th very bottom. I really like the vertical lines and I feel like the squares on the floor just disturbs the pattern. Other than that, it''s great!</td>', 'I think this is beautiful, but the only thing I would have done is crop out th very bottom. I really like the vertical lines and I feel like the squares on the floor just disturbs the pattern. Other than that, it''s great!', '2008-04-09 13:12:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627135, 664138, 70896, '<td valign="top">I agree with impilot, I think this needed a much tighter crop. The colors are rally nice, and the expressions are good. The plastic (?) on the right side is very distracting.</td>', 'I agree with impilot, I think this needed a much tighter crop. The colors are rally nice, and the expressions are good. The plastic (?) on the right side is very distracting.', '2008-04-09 13:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627165, 660324, 70896, '<td valign="top">I think I would have just shit the tree and left out the brick and the thing at the end. I really like the blue behind the branches and how it contrasts with the snow. Next time, tighter crop, maybe a bit more saturation?</td>', 'I think I would have just shit the tree and left out the brick and the thing at the end. I really like the blue behind the branches and how it contrasts with the snow. Next time, tighter crop, maybe a bit more saturation?', '2008-04-09 13:22:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627179, 657869, 70896, '<td valign="top">I LOVED THIS! I thought it was one of the most interesting shots in the challenge. The contrast, and the texture are really cool!</td>', 'I LOVED THIS! I thought it was one of the most interesting shots in the challenge. The contrast, and the texture are really cool!', '2008-04-09 13:28:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627187, 663642, 69368, '<td valign="top">only place 51? Can''t believe. It was a 10 from me because this was one of best in challenge! It''s underrated!<br/>This is wonderful seen, perfect DOF, great colors, etc! And a really lovely moment!</td>', 'only place 51? Can''t believe. It was a 10 from me because this was one of best in challenge! It''s underrated!This is wonderful seen, perfect DOF, great colors, etc! And a really lovely moment!', '2008-04-09 13:30:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627264, 664301, 63269, '<td valign="top">The colors and tones you have captured here are superb - excellent work!</td>', 'The colors and tones you have captured here are superb - excellent work!', '2008-04-09 13:54:29.000000', NULL, 0),
