(4627352, 664247, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition may not be all that strong (IMHO) but the details you''ve captured are terrific, and the rich colors and textures are so lovely! :)</td>', 'The composition may not be all that strong (IMHO) but the details you''ve captured are terrific, and the rich colors and textures are so lovely! :)', '2008-04-09 14:28:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627357, 661744, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love all the details, and the composition is good!</td>', 'I love all the details, and the composition is good!', '2008-04-09 14:29:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627443, 657634, 63269, '<td valign="top">I think the way the cropping rests right on the edge of the cat''s chin makes this feel a little akward, but I know how difficult it is to try and get a cat still enough to take a shot. Maybe it wasn''t possible to get a better crop. The same goes for the angle of the picture - with the shallow DOF, it would be nice to have the opposite eye in slightly more focus. Having one eye beautifuly focused and the other totally blurry looks a little startling, IMO. But for all I know the cat wasn''t cooporating. Just a thought. :) Other than those two things, this is a really, <i>really </i>lovely image. I love the dramatic shallow dof and the colors and rich contrast are superb.</td>', 'I think the way the cropping rests right on the edge of the cat''s chin makes this feel a little akward, but I know how difficult it is to try and get a cat still enough to take a shot. Maybe it wasn''t possible to get a better crop. The same goes for the angle of the picture - with the shallow DOF, it would be nice to have the opposite eye in slightly more focus. Having one eye beautifuly focused and the other totally blurry looks a little startling, IMO. But for all I know the cat wasn''t cooporating. Just a thought. :) Other than those two things, this is a really, really lovely image. I love the dramatic shallow dof and the colors and rich contrast are superb.', '2008-04-09 14:58:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627461, 663974, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. Very interesting, creative photo.</td>', 'I like the lighting. Very interesting, creative photo.', '2008-04-09 15:07:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627467, 663209, 63269, '<td valign="top">Although all the textures and the composition are a bit confusing, the colors and textures are <i>exquisite</i>!! I love this - very beautiful! :)</td>', 'Although all the textures and the composition are a bit confusing, the colors and textures are exquisite!! I love this - very beautiful! :)', '2008-04-09 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 0),
