(4627512, 662624, 63269, '<td valign="top">THe motion you have captured here is so perfect, and gives the image such a fun quality. Might be nice if there were some way to strengthen the bright colors even more. Good capture!</td>', 'THe motion you have captured here is so perfect, and gives the image such a fun quality. Might be nice if there were some way to strengthen the bright colors even more. Good capture!', '2008-04-09 15:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
