(4627520, 662080, 63269, '<td valign="top">Totally fantastic and surreal. Really neat capture!</td>', 'Totally fantastic and surreal. Really neat capture!', '2008-04-09 15:40:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627521, 663780, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrant contrasts here - terrific!</td>', 'I love the vibrant contrasts here - terrific!', '2008-04-09 15:40:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627525, 660141, 63269, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Not only are the colors, textures, and contrasts lovely, but with the bizarre reflections and everything it looks like two worlds merging together. Fascinating.</td>', 'I really like this. Not only are the colors, textures, and contrasts lovely, but with the bizarre reflections and everything it looks like two worlds merging together. Fascinating.', '2008-04-09 15:42:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627539, 659223, 63269, '<td valign="top">I really like how you''ve cropped and composed this so the person appears to be flying right out of the photo. It really does give a sense of "flying free." Well done!</td>', 'I really like how you''ve cropped and composed this so the person appears to be flying right out of the photo. It really does give a sense of "flying free." Well done!', '2008-04-09 15:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627561, 655555, 63269, '<td valign="top">At first I thought there should be a little more of the lighthouse - but now on second thought I think it''s perfect. Maybe it''s the border that''s bothering me, although it does add a nice light and airy feel to the whole image... I really like the subtle details of the branches in the bottom of the photo though, and the colors, which look like they''re straight from a painting, are lovely! Good shot.</td>', 'At first I thought there should be a little more of the lighthouse - but now on second thought I think it''s perfect. Maybe it''s the border that''s bothering me, although it does add a nice light and airy feel to the whole image... I really like the subtle details of the branches in the bottom of the photo though, and the colors, which look like they''re straight from a painting, are lovely! Good shot.', '2008-04-09 15:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627576, 664084, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks slightly over-exposed and even, alhtough I''m not really sure about this, a little out of focus... If there had been any way to fix that, and maybe add just a bit of contrast, that might help increase the impact of this photo. Excellent try though, and superb capture!</td>', 'This looks slightly over-exposed and even, alhtough I''m not really sure about this, a little out of focus... If there had been any way to fix that, and maybe add just a bit of contrast, that might help increase the impact of this photo. Excellent try though, and superb capture!', '2008-04-09 15:53:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627580, 663995, 63269, '<td valign="top">Fascinating - definitely deserved a better score!</td>', 'Fascinating - definitely deserved a better score!', '2008-04-09 15:54:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627588, 663691, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lovely! One minor nip-pick is the yellow sign... but the dark and misty tones are so beautiful. :)</td>', 'Lovely! One minor nip-pick is the yellow sign... but the dark and misty tones are so beautiful. :)', '2008-04-09 15:55:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627600, 662097, 63269, '<td valign="top">well, I personally would have tried to make the yellow a little more red-yellow instead of the greeny-yellow it appears to be on my screen. Just a thought. :) The splashes of light are very beautiful!</td>', 'well, I personally would have tried to make the yellow a little more red-yellow instead of the greeny-yellow it appears to be on my screen. Just a thought. :) The splashes of light are very beautiful!', '2008-04-09 15:58:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4627611, 664404, 63269, '<td valign="top">A little less contrast, so the white tree isn''t over-exposed, and perhaps a slightly different, more interesting pov (try moving the camera closer to the ground, perhaps) and I''ll bet this would have scored better. The colors are vivid and powerful though - good work!</td>', 'A little less contrast, so the white tree isn''t over-exposed, and perhaps a slightly different, more interesting pov (try moving the camera closer to the ground, perhaps) and I''ll bet this would have scored better. The colors are vivid and powerful though - good work!', '2008-04-09 16:00:49.000000', NULL, 0),
