(4628630, 655373, 58247, '<td valign="top">My apologies for taking so long to comment..<br/> <br/>I like the lighting of the background. The way if pulls focus to the center of the image works well. However, I think I''d have a tighter crop, and more light on the wilted flower. Perhaps you intended for it to be dark to underscore that it is dying, but I''d prefer to see some of the texture.</td>', 'My apologies for taking so long to comment.. I like the lighting of the background. The way if pulls focus to the center of the image works well. However, I think I''d have a tighter crop, and more light on the wilted flower. Perhaps you intended for it to be dark to underscore that it is dying, but I''d prefer to see some of the texture.', '2008-04-09 22:22:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628633, 662360, 58247, '<td valign="top">My apologies for the lateness of my comment...<br/> <br/>Wow, really nice image! the DOF is nice and the textures of the drops really pop. I might have expanded the border to not cut off the top of the flower, but it''s not that big of a deal to me.</td>', 'My apologies for the lateness of my comment... Wow, really nice image! the DOF is nice and the textures of the drops really pop. I might have expanded the border to not cut off the top of the flower, but it''s not that big of a deal to me.', '2008-04-09 22:25:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628641, 659097, 58247, '<td valign="top">My apologies for the lateness of my comment...<br/> <br/>There is alot of noise (surprisingly so for ISO 400), but that is not really a big issue for me. Noise can add to photos and in particular I think it could add to this photo. However, for that to happen I think this photo should have been converted to back and white. That would work much better than color.</td>', 'My apologies for the lateness of my comment... There is alot of noise (surprisingly so for ISO 400), but that is not really a big issue for me. Noise can add to photos and in particular I think it could add to this photo. However, for that to happen I think this photo should have been converted to back and white. That would work much better than color.', '2008-04-09 22:30:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628649, 662627, 58247, '<td valign="top">My apologies for the lateness of my comment...<br/> <br/>I think this is a very good photojournalistic photo. The mood and feel of the scene documented works well. I''m not sure I''d change anything about it.</td>', 'My apologies for the lateness of my comment... I think this is a very good photojournalistic photo. The mood and feel of the scene documented works well. I''m not sure I''d change anything about it.', '2008-04-09 22:35:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628653, 657035, 58247, '<td valign="top">My apologies for the lateness of my comment...<br/> <br/>Compositionally I really like the shot. I also like the detail in it. However, it has somewhat of the "cartoony" look to it that alot of HDR shots have.  That aspect of it, I don''t care for, but that is just my personal preference.</td>', 'My apologies for the lateness of my comment... Compositionally I really like the shot. I also like the detail in it. However, it has somewhat of the "cartoony" look to it that alot of HDR shots have.  That aspect of it, I don''t care for, but that is just my personal preference.', '2008-04-09 22:38:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628659, 660126, 58247, '<td valign="top">My apologies for the lateness of my comment...<br/> <br/>I like the angle of the image as well as the detail, but I think that overall it''s just a little too dark.</td>', 'My apologies for the lateness of my comment... I like the angle of the image as well as the detail, but I think that overall it''s just a little too dark.', '2008-04-09 22:40:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628733, 664460, 11769, '<td valign="top">:)</td>', ':)', '2008-04-09 23:01:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628748, 664475, 55838, '<td valign="top">A 5.45?!!!!  Sheesh!<br/>R<br/>O<br/>B<br/>B<br/>E<br/>D!!!<br/>I ran accross this gem while voting and had to call Tim over to the computer to take a look at this fun, different, entertaining, and well done photo.  Love the forehead - love the feet - love the fountain.  If I had an "aimeethetoo" ribbon, I''d give you eight of them.  Well done!  From one of your seven 8''s.</td>', 'A 5.45?!!!!  Sheesh!ROBBED!!!I ran accross this gem while voting and had to call Tim over to the computer to take a look at this fun, different, entertaining, and well done photo.  Love the forehead - love the feet - love the fountain.  If I had an "aimeethetoo" ribbon, I''d give you eight of them.  Well done!  From one of your seven 8''s.', '2008-04-09 23:05:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628750, 660013, 75034, '<td valign="top">Roz: you never cease to amaze me with your talent. The patients you have for this kind of shot speaks volumes to the type of photographer you are. <br/> <br/>This normally mundane insect passes under our noses as a pest and causes many people much grief, but you have this unbelievable talent to capture the beauty that this creature has and is usually seen by its mate and show it to us in such a fashion that I find inspiring. <br/> <br/>I love the macro shots you take of insects and will endeavor to do some of my own now that I see the beauty that they posses and the vibrant colours the mother nature has for us to see. <br/> <br/>Thank you Roz. You are truly one of the best this site has to offer.<br/> <br/>Keep them coming Roz YOU ROCK.<br/> <br/>All the best <br/> <br/>MAX!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-10 08:39:47.</i></td>', 'Roz: you never cease to amaze me with your talent. The patients you have for this kind of shot speaks volumes to the type of photographer you are.  This normally mundane insect passes under our noses as a pest and causes many people much grief, but you have this unbelievable talent to capture the beauty that this creature has and is usually seen by its mate and show it to us in such a fashion that I find inspiring.  I love the macro shots you take of insects and will endeavor to do some of my own now that I see the beauty that they posses and the vibrant colours the mother nature has for us to see.  Thank you Roz. You are truly one of the best this site has to offer. Keep them coming Roz YOU ROCK. All the best  MAX!', '2008-04-09 23:05:16.000000', '2008-04-10 09:39:47.000000', 0),
(4628766, 664197, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to see how you finished and whose this was.  Great shot - should have scored higher IMO.  Very nice.</td>', 'Back to see how you finished and whose this was.  Great shot - should have scored higher IMO.  Very nice.', '2008-04-09 23:12:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628779, 663642, 55838, '<td valign="top">Underrated IMO.  Very nice shot.  Of course top 51 in a Free Study is always a smashing success but I think this should have placed higher.</td>', 'Underrated IMO.  Very nice shot.  Of course top 51 in a Free Study is always a smashing success but I think this should have placed higher.', '2008-04-09 23:16:13.000000', NULL, 0),
