(4628795, 664245, 55838, '<td valign="top">Wow - top ten in a Free Study Baby!  You have arrived!  Congrats - well deserved.</td>', 'Wow - top ten in a Free Study Baby!  You have arrived!  Congrats - well deserved.', '2008-04-09 23:19:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628811, 664220, 55838, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to see how this shot finished and whose it was.  Very interesting and well composed photo.  Your story matches the type of passion that this pic seems to convey about this man.  Love the real life moment that you captured...a type of photography that I envy.  Very well done.</td>', 'I had to come back to see how this shot finished and whose it was.  Very interesting and well composed photo.  Your story matches the type of passion that this pic seems to convey about this man.  Love the real life moment that you captured...a type of photography that I envy.  Very well done.', '2008-04-09 23:24:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628828, 663043, 55838, '<td valign="top">HA!!  Came back to see whose this was and how it finished and I''m so glad it''s yours sweet Rina!!  What a cute little (but getting big!) guy.  You were two-too''d!  : ) I guess that serves as evidence that the Too''s simply have magnificant taste.  Well done.</td>', 'HA!!  Came back to see whose this was and how it finished and I''m so glad it''s yours sweet Rina!!  What a cute little (but getting big!) guy.  You were two-too''d!  : ) I guess that serves as evidence that the Too''s simply have magnificant taste.  Well done.', '2008-04-09 23:31:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628839, 664215, 55838, '<td valign="top">Ooooo - I see you got a Posthumous ribbon - very well deserved!  Excellent shot.  Congrat on the score north of 6 but I think it should have traveled a bit further north!  : )</td>', 'Ooooo - I see you got a Posthumous ribbon - very well deserved!  Excellent shot.  Congrat on the score north of 6 but I think it should have traveled a bit further north!  : )', '2008-04-09 23:35:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628842, 663254, 89515, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much for all the very nice comments! My best effort to date. It''s such an honor to receive great comments from photographers I respect alot.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you very much for all the very nice comments! My best effort to date. It''s such an honor to receive great comments from photographers I respect alot. ', '2008-04-09 23:35:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628843, 659996, 77838, '<td valign="top">Well, first of all, this ROCKS!  I nearly duplicated your photo with my entry! I want to post this first then read your other comments, just so my wording can be my own opinion.<br/> <br/>One change I might suggest would be to try to get the background a little lighter, (in brightness, not color).  I <u>do like</u> how it is completely out of focus though.  The background on my entry didn''t work out as well as this.  Maybe a way to lighten the background would be to enhance the overall image.  The bee could use just a bit more brightening which in turn might enhance the color too?...maybe?  I didn''t even get around to voting on this entry so I can''t really say I helped you or hurt you.  <br/> <br/>You did beat me by "TWO" places though, so you did something right. -BB</td>', 'Well, first of all, this ROCKS!  I nearly duplicated your photo with my entry! I want to post this first then read your other comments, just so my wording can be my own opinion. One change I might suggest would be to try to get the background a little lighter, (in brightness, not color).  I do like how it is completely out of focus though.  The background on my entry didn''t work out as well as this.  Maybe a way to lighten the background would be to enhance the overall image.  The bee could use just a bit more brightening which in turn might enhance the color too?...maybe?  I didn''t even get around to voting on this entry so I can''t really say I helped you or hurt you.   You did beat me by "TWO" places though, so you did something right. -BB', '2008-04-09 23:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
