(4640024, 664359, 15407, '<td valign="top">It is a nice picture... (at he Wave Organ at the end of the jetty at Sir Francis Drake Yacht Harbor) a place I often go to reflect how greatful I am for living in this area. That day revealed to me for the first time the ends of wthe organ ''pipes''... I''ve never been there when the tide was that low, which is why there were no sounds to be heard... maybe next time!<br/></td>', 'It is a nice picture... (at he Wave Organ at the end of the jetty at Sir Francis Drake Yacht Harbor) a place I often go to reflect how greatful I am for living in this area. That day revealed to me for the first time the ends of wthe organ ''pipes''... I''ve never been there when the tide was that low, which is why there were no sounds to be heard... maybe next time!', '2008-04-15 00:55:18.000000', NULL, 0),
