(4641642, 660400, 40977, '<td valign="top">I thought the composition was excellent, colors were great, and really gave a relaxing tone - which is why I excused the out of focus with an intentional softness. It did take a way some of the details, but I still love it and gave it a 9! Bravo on your first Free Study and cannot wait to see what you bring in the future.</td>', 'I thought the composition was excellent, colors were great, and really gave a relaxing tone - which is why I excused the out of focus with an intentional softness. It did take a way some of the details, but I still love it and gave it a 9! Bravo on your first Free Study and cannot wait to see what you bring in the future.', '2008-04-15 21:46:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4641973, 656600, 48697, '<td valign="top">Very cool, well done and nice finish!</td>', 'Very cool, well done and nice finish!', '2008-04-16 00:33:35.000000', NULL, 0),
