(4669485, 664234, 53814, '<td valign="top">My gut reaction to this is quite different than the comments made so far. Your use of a long lens has the expected effect of compressing the well-seen light, resulting in a visual feast, but, more importantly, it has given mother nature a boost in perspective, and apparently her intention is one of reclamation. The building has almost completely fallen to the approaching mountains, and despite the plea to "STOP", the transformer''s destiny has been determined. A rather uplifting photo.</td>', 'My gut reaction to this is quite different than the comments made so far. Your use of a long lens has the expected effect of compressing the well-seen light, resulting in a visual feast, but, more importantly, it has given mother nature a boost in perspective, and apparently her intention is one of reclamation. The building has almost completely fallen to the approaching mountains, and despite the plea to "STOP", the transformer''s destiny has been determined. A rather uplifting photo.', '2008-05-01 00:37:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4670374, 656600, 62357, '<td valign="top">Excellent conversion to b&amp;w and use of HDR was a great choice for this one.  The Lake is so calm it looks like a mirror.  There is so much to look at and take in.  (Not sure how you got a 1?  - never ceases to amaze me!)</td>', 'Excellent conversion to b&w and use of HDR was a great choice for this one.  The Lake is so calm it looks like a mirror.  There is so much to look at and take in.  (Not sure how you got a 1?  - never ceases to amaze me!)', '2008-05-01 08:50:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4673733, 664359, 68504, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, and the green sweater in this setting truly sets it off, all the hints of green in the water and stone. This is a photo I would prefer without any title at all, because it speaks for itself, but this is not apparently what we do here.</td>', 'Lovely composition, and the green sweater in this setting truly sets it off, all the hints of green in the water and stone. This is a photo I would prefer without any title at all, because it speaks for itself, but this is not apparently what we do here.', '2008-05-02 04:23:38.000000', NULL, 0),
