(5041214, 657737, 39427, '<td valign="top">this is a sick shot and the scene itself I''m sure was just insane.  You received a good score but it was no doubt hampered by some of the quality issues with this pic, namely the fact that the trees and mountain just seem to have way too much noise reduction on them... just doesn''t look sharp, looks smudgy.  Maybe you did this to get over the 800 ISO, i''m not sure, but if this shot was tack sharp I''m sure it would have top 10''d and maybe ribboned, what a spectacular scene.</td>', 'this is a sick shot and the scene itself I''m sure was just insane.  You received a good score but it was no doubt hampered by some of the quality issues with this pic, namely the fact that the trees and mountain just seem to have way too much noise reduction on them... just doesn''t look sharp, looks smudgy.  Maybe you did this to get over the 800 ISO, i''m not sure, but if this shot was tack sharp I''m sure it would have top 10''d and maybe ribboned, what a spectacular scene.', '2008-11-03 13:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
